#: data/text/trainers.inc:1
msgctxt "Route102_Text_CalvinIntro"
msgid ""
"If you have POKéMON with you, then\n"
"you're an official POKéMON TRAINER!\l"
"You can't say no to my challenge!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:6
msgctxt "Route102_Text_CalvinDefeated"
msgid ""
"Arrgh, I lost…\n"
"I should have trained mine more…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:10
msgctxt "Route102_Text_CalvinPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Listen, you. If you're strong,\n"
"you should have told me before!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:14
msgctxt "Route102_Text_CalvinRegister"
msgid ""
"I've been working hard at this since\n"
"I saw you before.\p"
"I'd like to battle you again, so can\n"
"you register me in your POKéNAV?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:20
msgctxt "Route102_Text_CalvinRegisterShort"
msgid ""
"I'd like to battle you again, so can\n"
"you register me in your POKéNAV?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:24
msgctxt "Route102_Text_CalvinRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"Ever since I lost to you, I desperately\n"
"trained my POKéMON.\l"
"You can't say no to my challenge!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:29
msgctxt "Route102_Text_CalvinRematchDefeated"
msgid ""
"Arrgh, I lost…\n"
"Is my training method not right?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:33
msgctxt "Route102_Text_CalvinRematchPostBattle"
msgid ""
"If you're going to get stronger,\n"
"I'll get stronger, too.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:37
msgctxt "Route102_Text_AllenIntro"
msgid ""
"Did you just become a TRAINER?\n"
"We're both beginners!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:41
msgctxt "Route102_Text_AllenDefeated"
msgid ""
"I called you because I thought\n"
"I could beat you…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:45
msgctxt "Route102_Text_AllenPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I haven't won once yet…\n"
"I wish I would win soon…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:49
msgctxt "Route102_Text_RickIntro"
msgid ""
"Hahah! Our eyes met!\n"
"I'll take you on with my BUG POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:53
msgctxt "Route102_Text_RickDefeated"
msgid "Ow! Down and out!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:56
msgctxt "Route102_Text_RickPostBattle"
msgid ""
"If you lock eyes with a TRAINER,\n"
"you have to challenge! It's a rule!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:60
msgctxt "Route102_Text_TianaIntro"
msgid ""
"I'm going to keep winning and aim\n"
"to be the best TRAINER.\p"
"Help me further my career!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:65
msgctxt "Route102_Text_TianaDefeated"
msgid "I ended up furthering your career…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:68
msgctxt "Route102_Text_TianaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"To keep winning my way up, I see that\n"
"I have to catch more POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:72
msgctxt "Route103_Text_DaisyIntro"
msgid ""
"Did you feel the tug of our\n"
"soul-soothing fragrance?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:76
msgctxt "Route103_Text_DaisyDefeated"
msgid "You weren't led astray by our aroma…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:79
msgctxt "Route103_Text_DaisyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Aromatherapy is a form of mental\n"
"healing that works with fragrances.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:83
msgctxt "Route103_Text_AmyIntro"
msgid ""
"AMY: I'm AMY.\n"
"And this is my little sister LIV.\l"
"We battle together!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:88
msgctxt "Route103_Text_AmyDefeated"
msgid "AMY: Uh-oh, we lost.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:91
msgctxt "Route103_Text_AmyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"AMY: You have to think about all\n"
"kinds of things when you're battling\l"
"against two TRAINERS.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:96
msgctxt "Route103_Text_AmyNotEnoughPokemon"
msgid ""
"AMY: Uh-oh, you have only one\n"
"POKéMON with you.\l"
"You can't battle us like that.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:101
msgctxt "Route103_Text_LivIntro"
msgid ""
"LIV: We battle together as one\n"
"team.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:105
msgctxt "Route103_Text_LivDefeated"
msgid "LIV: Oh, we lost, big sister…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:108
msgctxt "Route103_Text_LivPostBattle"
msgid ""
"LIV: We work perfectly together,\n"
"me and my big sister…\p"
"But we still lost…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:113
msgctxt "Route103_Text_AmyLivRegister"
msgid ""
"LIV: Really, we're a lot better…\n"
"It's true! We'll show you next time!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:117
msgctxt "Route103_Text_LivNotEnoughPokemon"
msgid ""
"LIV: If you want to battle us,\n"
"you have to have two POKéMON!\l"
"It's not fair if you don't!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:122
msgctxt "Route103_Text_AmyRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"AMY: I'm AMY.\n"
"And this is my little sister LIV.\l"
"We battle together!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:127
msgctxt "Route103_Text_AmyRematchDefeated"
msgid ""
"AMY: Aww, boo!\n"
"We couldn't win again…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:131
msgctxt "Route103_Text_AmyRematchPostBattle"
msgid ""
"AMY: You have to think about all\n"
"kinds of things when you're battling\l"
"against two TRAINERS.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:136
msgctxt "Route103_Text_AmyRematchNotEnoughPokemon"
msgid ""
"AMY: Uh-oh, you have only one\n"
"POKéMON with you.\l"
"You can't battle us like that.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:141
msgctxt "Route103_Text_LivRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"LIV: We battle together as one\n"
"team.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:145
msgctxt "Route103_Text_LivRematchDefeated"
msgid ""
"LIV: Awww, we lost again…\n"
"Big sister…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:149
msgctxt "Route103_Text_LivRematchPostBattle"
msgid ""
"LIV: We work perfectly together,\n"
"me and my big sister…\p"
"But why did we lose again?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:154
msgctxt "Route103_Text_LivRematchNotEnoughPokemon"
msgid ""
"LIV: If you want to battle us, you\n"
"have to have two POKéMON!\l"
"It's not fair if you don't!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:159
msgctxt "Route103_Text_AndrewIntro"
msgid ""
"Gah! My fishing line's all snarled up!\n"
"I'm getting frustrated and mean!\l"
"That's it! Battle me!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:164
msgctxt "Route103_Text_AndrewDefeated"
msgid ""
"Gah! Lost it!\n"
"I'm even more annoyed now!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:168
msgctxt "Route103_Text_AndrewPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Gah, I'm still boiling mad…\n"
"Grrrrr…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:172
msgctxt "Route103_Text_MiguelIntro"
msgid ""
"My POKéMON is delightfully adorable!\n"
"Don't be shy--I'll show you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:176
msgctxt "Route103_Text_MiguelDefeated"
msgid ""
"Oh, my gosh!\n"
"My darling POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:180
msgctxt "Route103_Text_MiguelPostBattle"
msgid ""
"My delightful POKéMON looks darling\n"
"even when it's fainted!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:184
msgctxt "Route103_Text_MiguelRegister"
msgid ""
"I'll get you to come out and look in\n"
"on my delightful POKéMON again!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:188
msgctxt "Route103_Text_MiguelRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"Hi, you! My delightfully adorable\n"
"POKéMON has become more darling!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:192
msgctxt "Route103_Text_MiguelRematchDefeated"
msgid ""
"Oh!\n"
"My darling POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:196
msgctxt "Route103_Text_MiguelRematchPostBattle"
msgid ""
"The more I spend time with it,\n"
"the more adorable my POKéMON becomes.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:200
msgctxt "Route103_Text_PeteIntro"
msgid ""
"This sort of distance…\n"
"You should just swim it!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:204
msgctxt "Route103_Text_PeteDefeated"
msgid "Oh, that's good going!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:207
msgctxt "Route103_Text_PetePostBattle"
msgid ""
"Oh, I understand where you're coming\n"
"from now.\p"
"If I had a POKéMON that trusty,\n"
"I'd want to SURF on it, too!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:213
msgctxt "Route103_Text_IsabelleIntro"
msgid ""
"Watch where you're going!\n"
"We're going to crash!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:217
msgctxt "Route103_Text_IsabelleDefeated"
msgid "Groan…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:220
msgctxt "Route103_Text_IsabellePostBattle"
msgid ""
"I'm a poor swimmer so I was practicing…\n"
"Sorry for almost crashing into you.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:224
msgctxt "Route103_Text_RhettIntro"
msgid ""
"Whoa!\n"
"How'd you get into a space this small?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:228
msgctxt "Route103_Text_RhettDefeated"
msgid ""
"Whoa!\n"
"The kid can rock!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:232
msgctxt "Route103_Text_RhettPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Do you like cramped quarters\n"
"like this?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:236
msgctxt "Route103_Text_MarcosIntro"
msgid "Did my guitar's wailing draw you in?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:239
msgctxt "Route103_Text_MarcosDefeated"
msgid "My one-man show is ruined…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:242
msgctxt "Route103_Text_MarcosPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I was playing my guitar where few\n"
"people were around, but a lot of fans\l"
"have gathered.\p"
"Heh, maybe I should turn pro.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:248
msgctxt "Route104_Text_GinaIntro"
msgid ""
"GINA: Okay, let's battle with our\n"
"POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:252
msgctxt "Route104_Text_GinaDefeat"
msgid "GINA: Losing upsets me!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:255
msgctxt "Route104_Text_GinaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"GINA: You are strong!\n"
"We have to train lots more!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:259
msgctxt "Route104_Text_GinaNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"GINA: Oh? Only one POKéMON?\n"
"Then, we don't battle with you.\p"
"If there's only one POKéMON, it will\n"
"be lonesome. That's not nice.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:265
msgctxt "Route104_Text_MiaIntro"
msgid ""
"MIA: We are twins, so we battle\n"
"POKéMON together.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:269
msgctxt "Route104_Text_MiaDefeat"
msgid ""
"MIA: We battled together, but we\n"
"both lost…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:273
msgctxt "Route104_Text_MiaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"MIA: We will train our POKéMON more\n"
"and be strong like you.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:277
msgctxt "Route104_Text_MiaNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"MIA: You want to battle with us?\p"
"It's a big no-no if you don't have two\n"
"POKéMON with you.\l"
"We're too strong for you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:283
msgctxt "Route104_Text_IvanIntro"
msgid ""
"Why keep it a secret?\n"
"I'm the WATER POKéMON expert!\p"
"Huh?\n"
"You don't know me?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:289
msgctxt "Route104_Text_IvanDefeat"
msgid ""
"I thought I wasn't too bad, if I may\n"
"say so, but I guess not… Bleah…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:293
msgctxt "Route104_Text_IvanPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I got too into fishing.\n"
"I forgot I had to raise my POKéMON…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:297
msgctxt "Route104_Text_BillyIntro"
msgid ""
"Leaving footprints in the sand is\n"
"so fun!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:301
msgctxt "Route104_Text_BillyDefeat"
msgid ""
"Waah! I got sand in my runners!\n"
"They're all gritty!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:305
msgctxt "Route104_Text_BillyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I want to leave my footprints in\n"
"the sand everywhere, but they\l"
"disappear quickly…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:310
msgctxt "Route104_Text_HaleyIntro"
msgid ""
"Should I…\n"
"Or shouldn't I?\p"
"Okay, sure, I will battle!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:315
msgctxt "Route104_Text_HaleyDefeat"
msgid "I shouldn't have battled…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:318
msgctxt "Route104_Text_HaleyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"If you're faced with a decision and\n"
"you let someone else choose for you,\l"
"you will regret it, however things\l"
"turn out.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:324
msgctxt "Route104_Text_HaleyRegister1"
msgid ""
"You're strong, but should I register\n"
"you in my POKéNAV?\l"
"Maybe I shouldn't…\p"
"Okay, sure, I will register you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:330
msgctxt "Route104_Text_HaleyRegister2"
msgid ""
"You're strong, but should I register\n"
"you in my POKéNAV?\l"
"Maybe I shouldn't…\p"
"Okay, sure, I will register you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:336
msgctxt "Route104_Text_HaleyRematchIntro"
msgid "Come on, battle with me!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:339
msgctxt "Route104_Text_HaleyRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"Ohh…\n"
"I thought I could win…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:343
msgctxt "Route104_Text_HaleyPostRematch"
msgid ""
"I made the decision to battle, so\n"
"I can accept this loss with grace.\p"
"I am still upset about losing!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:348
msgctxt "Route104_Text_WinstonIntro"
msgid ""
"Oh, sure, I'll accept your challenge.\n"
"I have a lot of money.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:352
msgctxt "Route104_Text_WinstonDefeat"
msgid "Why couldn't I win?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:355
msgctxt "Route104_Text_WinstonPostBattle"
msgid ""
"There are some things money can't buy.\n"
"That's POKéMON…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:359
msgctxt "Route104_Text_WinstonRegister1"
msgid ""
"Hm?\n"
"Ah, you've obtained a POKéNAV.\p"
"I will gladly register you.\n"
"After all, I have plenty of money.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:365
msgctxt "Route104_Text_WinstonRegister2"
msgid ""
"Hm?\n"
"Ah, you've obtained a POKéNAV.\p"
"I will gladly register you.\n"
"After all, I have plenty of money.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:371
msgctxt "Route104_Text_WinstonRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"After I lost to you, I learned a bunch\n"
"of things about POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:375
msgctxt "Route104_Text_WinstonRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"I lost again?\n"
"Why couldn't I win?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:379
msgctxt "Route104_Text_WinstonPostRematch"
msgid ""
"I'm fabulously wealthy, but I can't\n"
"seem to win at POKéMON…\p"
"It's so deep, the world of POKéMON…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:384
msgctxt "Route104_Text_CindyIntro"
msgid ""
"We must have been fated to meet.\n"
"May I ask you for a battle?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:388
msgctxt "Route104_Text_CindyDefeat"
msgid "Oh, my!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:391
msgctxt "Route104_Text_CindyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"“Hello” is the beginning of “good-bye.”\n"
"I hope we meet again.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:395
msgctxt "Route104_Text_CindyRegister1"
msgid ""
"Hello, we meet again.\p"
"We seem to be drawn together. Let's\n"
"register each other in our POKéNAVS.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:400
msgctxt "Route104_Text_CindyRegister2"
msgid ""
"We should commemorate how we seem\n"
"to be drawn to each other.\p"
"Let's register each other in our\n"
"POKéNAVS.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:406
msgctxt "Route104_Text_CindyRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"Hello, we meet again.\n"
"May I ask you for a battle?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:410
msgctxt "Route104_Text_CindyRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"Oh, my…\n"
"I did the best that I could…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:414
msgctxt "Route104_Text_CindyPostRematch"
msgid ""
"“Hello” is the beginning of “good-bye.”\n"
"I hope we meet again.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:418
msgctxt "Route104_Text_DarianIntro"
msgid ""
"I fished up a tough-looking POKéMON!\p"
"It has this magical quality to it!\n"
"It surely looks tough, yes it does!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:423
msgctxt "Route104_Text_DarianDefeat"
msgid "What the…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:426
msgctxt "Route104_Text_DarianPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Hey, MAGIKARP, you sure don't live up\n"
"to your name, do you?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:430
msgctxt "Route105_Text_FosterIntro"
msgid ""
"There's supposed to be a mystical\n"
"rock around here.\l"
"Do you know anything about it?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:435
msgctxt "Route105_Text_FosterDefeated"
msgid ""
"I was thinking too much about that\n"
"rock, while my POKéMON remained weak…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:439
msgctxt "Route105_Text_FosterPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I can spend hours and hours staring\n"
"at a nice rock without growing bored.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:443
msgctxt "Route105_Text_LuisIntro"
msgid ""
"Whew! I was worried that a kid was\n"
"drowning when I saw you.\p"
"You seem to be okay, so what do you\n"
"say to a battle?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:449
msgctxt "Route105_Text_LuisDefeated"
msgid "Glub… Glub…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:452
msgctxt "Route105_Text_LuisPostBattle"
msgid ""
"If you are drowning, the signal is to\n"
"wave one arm toward the beach.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:456
msgctxt "Route105_Text_DominikIntro"
msgid ""
"Swimming the deep blue sea…\n"
"It feels the greatest!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:460
msgctxt "Route105_Text_DominikDefeated"
msgid ""
"I lost…\n"
"Now I'm feeling blue…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:464
msgctxt "Route105_Text_DominikPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Why is the sea blue?\p"
"I learned about that at the MUSEUM in\n"
"SLATEPORT, but I forgot.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:469
msgctxt "Route105_Text_BeverlyIntro"
msgid ""
"My body feels lighter in the water.\n"
"It's as if I've gotten slimmer!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:473
msgctxt "Route105_Text_BeverlyDefeated"
msgid "I'm floating…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:476
msgctxt "Route105_Text_PostBattle"
msgid ""
"Your body weight is reduced to just\n"
"one tenth in the water.\p"
"That would make me…\n"
"Whoops! I'm not telling you my weight!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:482
msgctxt "Route105_Text_ImaniIntro"
msgid ""
"The blue, blue sky…\n"
"The vast sea…\l"
"It's so peaceful…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:487
msgctxt "Route105_Text_ImaniDefeated"
msgid "I lost while I was lounging!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:490
msgctxt "Route105_Text_ImaniPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I want to be told I'm relaxing to be\n"
"with. Giggle.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:494
msgctxt "Route105_Text_AndresIntro"
msgid ""
"I'm convinced that the sea keeps\n"
"secrets from us.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:498
msgctxt "Route105_Text_AndresDefeated"
msgid ""
"Yes…\n"
"I am no good at battling…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:502
msgctxt "Route105_Text_AndresPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I'm sure there are many secrets to be\n"
"discovered in the world's seas.\p"
"I mean to find them all!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:507
msgctxt "Route105_Text_AndresRegister"
msgid ""
"Huh? I'm so weak, but you're willing\n"
"to register me in your POKéNAV?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:511
msgctxt "Route105_Text_AndresRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"I've told you that I'm weak…\n"
"Are you sure you want to do this?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:515
msgctxt "Route105_Text_AndresRematchDefeated"
msgid ""
"Yes…\n"
"I didn't think I could win.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:519
msgctxt "Route105_Text_AndresRematchPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I may be weak at battling, but my\n"
"drive to explore can't be bested.\p"
"I will travel the seas all around\n"
"the world!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:525
msgctxt "Route105_Text_JosueIntro"
msgid ""
"I'm exhausted from swimming.\n"
"I'm just not used to it.\p"
"I need a battle for a change of pace!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:530
msgctxt "Route105_Text_JosueDefeated"
msgid "I lost because I battled at sea.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:533
msgctxt "Route105_Text_JosuePostBattle"
msgid ""
"Yeah, for me, the sky is a much better\n"
"match than the sea.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:537
msgctxt "Route106_Text_ElliotIntro"
msgid ""
"Which do you prefer, fishing in the\n"
"sea or a stream?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:541
msgctxt "Route106_Text_ElliotDefeated"
msgid ""
"Like in deep-sea fishing, I lost\n"
"spectacularly!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:545
msgctxt "Route106_Text_ElliotPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Fishing is the greatest whether it's\n"
"in the sea or a stream.\l"
"You agree with me, right?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:550
msgctxt "Route106_Text_ElliotRegister"
msgid ""
"Fishing's great, but so is battling.\n"
"If you don't mind, can we meet again?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:554
msgctxt "Route106_Text_ElliotRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"I caught a bunch of POKéMON fishing.\n"
"I'll show you an impressive battle!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:558
msgctxt "Route106_Text_ElliotRematchDefeated"
msgid "I lost again spectacularly!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:561
msgctxt "Route106_Text_ElliotRematchPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Win or lose, POKéMON are the greatest!\n"
"You agree with me, right?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:565
msgctxt "Route106_Text_NedIntro"
msgid ""
"What do people do if they need to go\n"
"to a washroom?\p"
"What if my ROD hooks a big one while\n"
"I'm in the washroom? I just can't go…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:571
msgctxt "Route106_Text_NedDefeated"
msgid ""
"I lost because I'm trying to not go\n"
"to the washroom…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:575
msgctxt "Route106_Text_NedPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Oh, no! I've got this feeling I'll hook\n"
"a big one!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:579
msgctxt "Route106_Text_DouglasIntro"
msgid ""
"Hahahah! I'm a lousy runner, but in\n"
"the water you can't catch me!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:583
msgctxt "Route106_Text_DouglasDefeated"
msgid "I give up!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:586
msgctxt "Route106_Text_DouglasPostBattle"
msgid "I wouldn't lose in a swim race…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:589
msgctxt "Route106_Text_KylaIntro"
msgid ""
"The sea is my backyard. I'm not going\n"
"to take it easy because you're a kid!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:593
msgctxt "Route106_Text_KylaDefeated"
msgid ""
"Did you take it easy on me by any\n"
"chance?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:597
msgctxt "Route106_Text_KylaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Drifting along with the waves…\n"
"I love it! Why don't you give it a try?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:601
msgctxt "Route107_Text_DarrinIntro"
msgid ""
"Yawn…\p"
"I must have drifted off to sleep while\n"
"I was drifting in the waves.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:606
msgctxt "Route107_Text_DarrinDefeated"
msgid ""
"Ahaha, I lost…\n"
"I'll take a snooze, I think…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:610
msgctxt "Route107_Text_DarrinPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Floating and being rocked by\n"
"the waves--it's like sleeping in\l"
"a plush, comfy bed.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:615
msgctxt "Route107_Text_TonyIntro"
msgid ""
"The sea is like my backyard.\n"
"Let's battle!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:619
msgctxt "Route107_Text_TonyDefeated"
msgid ""
"I lost on my home field…\n"
"I'm in shock!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:623
msgctxt "Route107_Text_TonyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I swim the seas with a heart full of\n"
"dreams…\p"
"It's a song!\n"
"Anyways, I'm swimming some more.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:629
msgctxt "Route107_Text_TonyRegister"
msgid ""
"You've shocked me to the bone!\n"
"Well, so you won't forget me…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:633
msgctxt "Route107_Text_TonyRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"Swimming in the big, wide sea,\n"
"my POKéMON has grown stronger!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:637
msgctxt "Route107_Text_TonyRematchDefeated"
msgid ""
"What a shock!\p"
"My POKéMON has gotten stronger, but\n"
"I stayed weak as a TRAINER!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:642
msgctxt "Route107_Text_TonyRematchPostBattle"
msgid ""
"What you learn in battle makes you\n"
"a stronger TRAINER.\l"
"The waves taught me that.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:647
msgctxt "Route107_Text_DeniseIntro"
msgid ""
"Do you know a little town called\n"
"DEWFORD?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:651
msgctxt "Route107_Text_DeniseDefeated"
msgid "I hate this!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:654
msgctxt "Route107_Text_DenisePostBattle"
msgid ""
"A weird saying is getting really\n"
"trendy at DEWFORD HALL.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:658
msgctxt "Route107_Text_BethIntro"
msgid ""
"Did you want to battle me?\n"
"Sure, I'll go with you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:662
msgctxt "Route107_Text_BethDefeated"
msgid "I wasn't good enough for you.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:665
msgctxt "Route107_Text_BethPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I think you're going to keep getting\n"
"better. I'll go for it, too!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:669
msgctxt "Route107_Text_LisaIntro"
msgid ""
"LISA: We challenge you as a sister\n"
"and brother!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:673
msgctxt "Route107_Text_LisaDefeated"
msgid ""
"LISA: Awesome.\n"
"You're in a different class of tough.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:677
msgctxt "Route107_Text_LisaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"LISA: Do you have any friends who\n"
"would go to the beach with you?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:681
msgctxt "Route107_Text_LisaNotEnoughPokemon"
msgid ""
"LISA: If you want to battle with us,\n"
"bring more POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:685
msgctxt "Route107_Text_RayIntro"
msgid ""
"RAY: We always battle POKéMON,\n"
"me and my sister.\p"
"I always lose, but we can beat you\n"
"2-on-2!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:691
msgctxt "Route107_Text_RayDefeated"
msgid ""
"RAY: Wowee, you're at a higher level\n"
"than us!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:695
msgctxt "Route107_Text_RayPostBattle"
msgid ""
"RAY: My sister gave me my POKéMON.\n"
"I raised it, and now it's my important\l"
"partner!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:700
msgctxt "Route107_Text_RayNotEnoughPokemon"
msgid ""
"RAY: If you want to battle us,\n"
"go bring some more POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:704
msgctxt "Route107_Text_CamronIntro"
msgid ""
"I'm in the middle of a triathlon,\n"
"but I'm nowhere near tired!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:708
msgctxt "Route107_Text_CamronDefeated"
msgid "That exhausted me…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:711
msgctxt "Route107_Text_CamronPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I still have swimming and running left\n"
"to do after this.\p"
"Am I going to be okay?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:716
msgctxt "Route108_Text_JeromeIntro"
msgid ""
"My dream is to swim the world's seven\n"
"seas!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:720
msgctxt "Route108_Text_JeromeDefeated"
msgid ""
"I won't be able to swim the seven seas\n"
"like this…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:724
msgctxt "Route108_Text_JeromePostBattle"
msgid ""
"Playing with marine POKéMON is one of\n"
"the pleasures of swimming!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:728
msgctxt "Route108_Text_MatthewIntro"
msgid ""
"Ahoy, there! Are you going out to\n"
"the ABANDONED SHIP, too?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:732
msgctxt "Route108_Text_MatthewDefeated"
msgid ""
"I'm sinking!\n"
"Glub… Glub…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:736
msgctxt "Route108_Text_MatthewPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Some people even go inside that\n"
"ABANDONED SHIP.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:740
msgctxt "Route108_Text_TaraIntro"
msgid ""
"My liar of a boyfriend told me that\n"
"I look great in a bikini…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:744
msgctxt "Route108_Text_TaraDefeated"
msgid "Oh, boo!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:747
msgctxt "Route108_Text_TaraPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Even if it's a lie, I love being told\n"
"I look great…\l"
"We girls are so complex…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:752
msgctxt "Route108_Text_MissyIntro"
msgid ""
"I love the sea!\n"
"I forget all my worries when I swim!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:756
msgctxt "Route108_Text_MissyDefeated"
msgid ""
"When I lose a battle, I get all\n"
"stressed out!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:760
msgctxt "Route108_Text_MissyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Work off your stress by swimming!\n"
"It's so healthy!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:764
msgctxt "Route108_Text_CoryIntro"
msgid ""
"I love WATER-type POKéMON.\n"
"I love other POKéMON, too!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:768
msgctxt "Route108_Text_CoryDefeated"
msgid ""
"Waaah! I lost!\n"
"Waaah! Waaah!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:772
msgctxt "Route108_Text_CoryPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Shouting is good for me!\n"
"It uplifts me!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:776
msgctxt "Route108_Text_CoryRegister"
msgid ""
"I love tough TRAINERS, too!\n"
"Register me in your POKéNAV!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:780
msgctxt "Route108_Text_CoryRematchIntro"
msgid "Win or lose, I love battling at sea!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:783
msgctxt "Route108_Text_CoryRematchDefeated"
msgid ""
"Waaah! I lost again!\n"
"Waaah! Waaah!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:787
msgctxt "Route108_Text_CoryRematchPostBattle"
msgid ""
"If you're faced with a challenge,\n"
"try shouting at the sea!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:791
msgctxt "Route108_Text_CarolinaIntro"
msgid ""
"I take huge pride in my POKéMON.\n"
"We'll show you one speedy battle!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:795
msgctxt "Route108_Text_CarolinaDefeated"
msgid "That wasn't cute at all.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:798
msgctxt "Route108_Text_CarolinaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Since I'm at sea like this, I wouldn't\n"
"mind putting on a pink, frilly swimsuit…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:802
msgctxt "Route109_Text_DavidIntro"
msgid ""
"Hiyah! Look at my chiseled abs!\n"
"This is what you call “cut”!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:806
msgctxt "Route109_Text_DavidDefeated"
msgid ""
"Aiyah!\n"
"Flubbed out!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:810
msgctxt "Route109_Text_DavidPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Hiyah!\p"
"My sculpted abs have nothing to do\n"
"with POKéMON battles!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:815
msgctxt "Route109_Text_AliceIntro"
msgid ""
"Are you properly protected against\n"
"the sun?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:819
msgctxt "Route109_Text_AliceDefeated"
msgid "Ouch, ouch, ouch!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:822
msgctxt "Route109_Text_AlicePostBattle"
msgid "Cheeks are the most prone to burning!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:825
msgctxt "Route109_Text_HueyIntro"
msgid ""
"I've laid anchor in ports around\n"
"the world, but SLATEPORT's the best.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:829
msgctxt "Route109_Text_HueyDefeated"
msgid "You're the best!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:832
msgctxt "Route109_Text_HueyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"In the best port was the best\n"
"TRAINER…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:836
msgctxt "Route109_Text_EdmondIntro"
msgid ""
"Urrrrppp…\n"
"Battle? With me?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:840
msgctxt "Route109_Text_EdmondDefeated"
msgid ""
"Urp… Ooooooohhhhhh…\n"
"Urrrrpppp…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:844
msgctxt "Route109_Text_EdmondPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I'm usually stronger than this!\n"
"I'm just seasick as a dog!\p"
"I'm a SAILOR, but…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:849
msgctxt "Route109_Text_RickyIntro"
msgid ""
"I'm thirsty… I could go for a SODA POP\n"
"at the SEASHORE HOUSE…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:853
msgctxt "Route109_Text_RickyDefeated"
msgid "Groan…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:856
msgctxt "Route109_Text_RickyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I'm getting famished… My inner tube\n"
"looks like a giant doughnut…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:860
msgctxt "Route109_Text_RickyRegister"
msgid ""
"Will you have another match with me\n"
"when I'm not all thirsty?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:864
msgctxt "Route109_Text_RickyRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"I'm hungry, but I've got enough pep in\n"
"me for a battle!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:868
msgctxt "Route109_Text_RickyRematchDefeated"
msgid ""
"I lost…\n"
"It's because I'm hungry…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:872
msgctxt "Route109_Text_RickyRematchPostBattle"
msgid ""
"When you eat on a beach, everything\n"
"seems to taste a little better.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:876
msgctxt "Route109_Text_LolaIntro"
msgid ""
"Doesn't a beach umbrella look like\n"
"a giant flower?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:880
msgctxt "Route109_Text_LolaDefeated"
msgid "Mommy!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:883
msgctxt "Route109_Text_LolaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"If you look at the beach from the sky,\n"
"it looks like a big flower garden!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:887
msgctxt "Route109_Text_LolaRegister"
msgid ""
"Me?\n"
"I'm here every day!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:891
msgctxt "Route109_Text_LolaRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"I'm not losing to you again!\n"
"That's why I have my inner tube!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:895
msgctxt "Route109_Text_LolaRematchDefeated"
msgid "Mommy!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:898
msgctxt "Route109_Text_LolaRematchPostBattle"
msgid ""
"If I have an inner tube, me and my\n"
"POKéMON's cuteness goes way up!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:902
msgctxt "Route109_Text_AustinaIntro"
msgid ""
"I can't swim without my inner tube,\n"
"but I won't lose at POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:906
msgctxt "Route109_Text_AustinaDefeated"
msgid ""
"Did I lose because I have an inner\n"
"tube?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:910
msgctxt "Route109_Text_AustinaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"My inner tube is a fashion item.\n"
"I can't be seen without it.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:914
msgctxt "Route109_Text_GwenIntro"
msgid ""
"Hi, big TRAINER.\n"
"Will you battle with me?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:918
msgctxt "Route109_Text_GwenDefeated"
msgid "Oh, you're strong.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:921
msgctxt "Route109_Text_GwenPostBattle"
msgid "How did you get to be so strong?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:924
msgctxt "Route109_Text_CarterIntro"
msgid ""
"Wahahah! This dude's going to catch\n"
"himself a big one!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:928
msgctxt "Route109_Text_CarterDefeated"
msgid "This dude just lost one…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:931
msgctxt "Route109_Text_CarterPostBattle"
msgid ""
"This dude thinks you're a big one.\n"
"No, you're a big-one-to-be!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:935
msgctxt "Route109_Text_PaulIntro"
msgid ""
"PAUL: Well, this is a mood-breaker.\p"
"I wish you wouldn't disturb our\n"
"precious time together.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:940
msgctxt "Route109_Text_PaulDefeated"
msgid "PAUL: Well, I give up.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:943
msgctxt "Route109_Text_PaulPostBattle"
msgid ""
"PAUL: Well, don't tell anyone that\n"
"we're here.\l"
"This is just our private world of two!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:948
msgctxt "Route109_Text_PaulNotEnoughPokemon"
msgid ""
"PAUL: We're totally, deeply in love.\n"
"That's why we make our POKéMON battle\l"
"together.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:953
msgctxt "Route109_Text_MelIntro"
msgid ""
"MEL: We're, like, totally in love.\n"
"Our romance is heating up all of HOENN!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:957
msgctxt "Route109_Text_MelDefeated"
msgid ""
"MEL: We lost, and it's my fault!\n"
"PAUL will hate me!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:961
msgctxt "Route109_Text_MelPostBattle"
msgid ""
"MEL: Um, PAUL, are you angry with me?\n"
"Please don't be angry.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:965
msgctxt "Route109_Text_MelNotEnoughPokemon"
msgid ""
"MEL: We're, like, deeply and truly in love.\n"
"That's why we make our POKéMON\l"
"battle together.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:970
msgctxt "Route109_Text_ChandlerIntro"
msgid ""
"Tadaah! See?\n"
"My inner tube's round!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:974
msgctxt "Route109_Text_ChandlerDefeated"
msgid ""
"Oh, oh!\n"
"Too bad!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:978
msgctxt "Route109_Text_ChandlerPostBattle"
msgid ""
"After I showed you my round inner\n"
"tube, too…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:982
msgctxt "Route109_Text_HaileyIntro"
msgid ""
"I can't swim, so I'm pretending\n"
"to swim.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:986
msgctxt "Route109_Text_HaileyDefeated"
msgid ""
"I thought so!\n"
"I didn't think we could win.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:990
msgctxt "Route109_Text_HaileyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"When I learn how to swim, I think\n"
"my POKéMON will become tougher.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:994
msgctxt "Route109_Text_ElijahIntro"
msgid ""
"For a guy as macho as me, this kind\n"
"of POKéMON is the perfect match!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:998
msgctxt "Route109_Text_ElijahDefeated"
msgid "I'm cool even in defeat, hey?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1001
msgctxt "Route109_Text_ElijahPostBattle"
msgid ""
"For a guy as macho as me, a port\n"
"is the perfect setting!\p"
"I guess I'll head for SLATEPORT.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1006
msgctxt "Route110_Text_JacobIntro"
msgid ""
"Whoa! Watch it!\n"
"I guess you're not used to BIKE racing.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1010
msgctxt "Route110_Text_JacobDefeated"
msgid ""
"Whoa!\n"
"My brakes failed!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1014
msgctxt "Route110_Text_JacobPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Flat tires and brake problems can\n"
"cause serious injury!\l"
"Inspect your BIKE for problems!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1019
msgctxt "Route110_Text_AnthonyIntro"
msgid ""
"Yo, you!\n"
"Can you keep up with my speed?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1023
msgctxt "Route110_Text_AnthonyDefeated"
msgid "Crash and burn!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1026
msgctxt "Route110_Text_AnthonyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Speed alone won't let me win at POKéMON.\n"
"I need to reconsider this…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1030
msgctxt "Route110_Text_BenjaminIntro"
msgid "Don't panic if your BIKE's going fast!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1033
msgctxt "Route110_Text_BenjaminDefeated"
msgid ""
"I shouldn't panic during POKéMON\n"
"battles…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1037
msgctxt "Route110_Text_BenjaminPostBattle"
msgid ""
"There's no need to panic or stress.\n"
"Take it easy. There's plenty of time.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1041
msgctxt "Route110_Text_BenjaminRegister"
msgid ""
"I'll keep chugging on without stressing.\n"
"Give me a shout if you're up to it.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1045
msgctxt "Route110_Text_BenjaminRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"Aren't you going a little too fast?\n"
"Take it easy and let's battle.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1049
msgctxt "Route110_Text_BenjaminRematchDefeated"
msgid "I didn't panic, but I still lost…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1052
msgctxt "Route110_Text_BenjaminRematchPostBattle"
msgid ""
"There's no need to panic or stress.\n"
"Take it easy. There's plenty of time.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1056
msgctxt "Route110_Text_AbigailIntro"
msgid ""
"The triathlon is hard in the extreme.\p"
"You have to complete the three events\n"
"of swimming, cycling, and running.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1061
msgctxt "Route110_Text_AbigailDefeated"
msgid "POKéMON battles are hard, too!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1064
msgctxt "Route110_Text_AbigailPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I'm exhausted, so I need a break.\n"
"It's important to get proper rest.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1068
msgctxt "Route110_Text_AbigailRegister"
msgid ""
"You know, I like you!\n"
"Let's have a rematch on CYCLING ROAD.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1072
msgctxt "Route110_Text_AbigailRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"Isn't it neat to hold a battle while\n"
"cycling?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1076
msgctxt "Route110_Text_AbigailRematchDefeated"
msgid ""
"Wow…\n"
"How could you be so strong?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1080
msgctxt "Route110_Text_AbigailRematchPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Were you going after a record?\p"
"I'm sorry if I held you up!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1084
msgctxt "Route110_Text_JasmineIntro"
msgid ""
"I've been riding without stopping.\n"
"My thighs are like rocks!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1088
msgctxt "Route110_Text_JasmineDefeated"
msgid "I'm worried about muscle cramps…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1091
msgctxt "Route110_Text_JasminePostBattle"
msgid ""
"Oh, you have some GYM BADGES?\n"
"No wonder you're so strong!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1095
msgctxt "Route110_Text_EdwardIntro"
msgid ""
"I have foreseen your intentions!\n"
"I cannot possibly lose!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1099
msgctxt "Route110_Text_EdwardDefeated"
msgid "I failed to prophesize my own demise!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1102
msgctxt "Route110_Text_EdwardPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I see your future…\p"
"Hmm…\n"
"I see a shining light…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1107
msgctxt "Route110_Text_JaclynIntro"
msgid ""
"Ahahahaha!\n"
"I'll dazzle you with my wonders!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1111
msgctxt "Route110_Text_JaclynDefeated"
msgid "I wondrously lost!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1114
msgctxt "Route110_Text_JaclynPostBattle"
msgid ""
"You managed to win only because it was\n"
"a wonder! Yes, a wonder!\l"
"Don't think you can win all the time!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1119
msgctxt "Route110_Text_EdwinIntro"
msgid ""
"Could I see your POKéMON?\n"
"Just one look, please?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1123
msgctxt "Route110_Text_EdwinDefeated"
msgid ""
"I wanted to complete\n"
"my collection…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1127
msgctxt "Route110_Text_EdwinPostBattle"
msgid ""
"When I see a POKéMON that I don't know,\n"
"my passion as a collector is ignited!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1131
msgctxt "Route110_Text_EdwinRegister"
msgid ""
"I like collecting MATCH CALL\n"
"registrations, too…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1135
msgctxt "Route110_Text_EdwinRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"Hi, have you caught any new POKéMON?\p"
"Could I see your POKéMON?\n"
"Just one look, please?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1140
msgctxt "Route110_Text_EdwinRematchDefeated"
msgid ""
"Your POKéMON…\n"
"I envy you.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1144
msgctxt "Route110_Text_EdwinRematchPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Oh, I long to make all rare POKéMON\n"
"mine!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1148
msgctxt "Route110_Text_DaleIntro"
msgid ""
"Hey!\n"
"Don't sneak up behind me like that!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1152
msgctxt "Route110_Text_DaleDefeated"
msgid ""
"I lost!\n"
"Drat!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1156
msgctxt "Route110_Text_DalePostBattle"
msgid ""
"Fishing is all about concentration.\n"
"You have to focus on the floater.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1160
msgctxt "Route110_Text_IsabelIntro"
msgid ""
"Ahahaha! I would go anywhere to show\n"
"off my delightful POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1164
msgctxt "Route110_Text_IsabelDefeated"
msgid "Oh, dear, this won't do.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1167
msgctxt "Route110_Text_IsabelPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Rather than battling, perhaps I should\n"
"show off my POKéMON at the FAN CLUB.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1171
msgctxt "Route110_Text_IsabelRegister"
msgid ""
"That wasn't close to what I could\n"
"do to show off my POKéMON.\p"
"I'll have you as my captive audience\n"
"as often as possible!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1177
msgctxt "Route110_Text_IsabelRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"Ahahahaha! I would be happy to show\n"
"off my POKéMON as often as you like!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1181
msgctxt "Route110_Text_IsabelRematchDefeated"
msgid "Oh, dear, this won't do.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1184
msgctxt "Route110_Text_IsabelRematchPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I don't think that I could ever stop\n"
"from showing off my POKéMON.\p"
"But I like to battle, too!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1189
msgctxt "Route110_Text_TimmyIntro"
msgid ""
"I found some cool POKéMON in the grass\n"
"around here!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1193
msgctxt "Route110_Text_TimmyDefeated"
msgid "Being cool isn't enough to win…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1196
msgctxt "Route110_Text_TimmyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"It's hard to battle with POKéMON you\n"
"just caught.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1200
msgctxt "Route110_Text_AlyssaIntro"
msgid ""
"I fell off CYCLING ROAD…\p"
"I'll get over my embarrassment by\n"
"battling with you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1205
msgctxt "Route110_Text_AlyssaDefeated"
msgid ""
"Oops!\n"
"I ended up losing!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1209
msgctxt "Route110_Text_AlyssaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Falling… Losing…\n"
"This is so humiliating for me!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1213
msgctxt "Route110_Text_JosephIntro"
msgid ""
"Okay! Full-throttle time! If you can't\n"
"groove, you get left behind!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1217
msgctxt "Route110_Text_JosephDefeated"
msgid "You got into the groove all right…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1220
msgctxt "Route110_Text_JosephPostBattle"
msgid ""
"This isn't going to bring me down!\n"
"Losing has made me a better man!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1224
msgctxt "Route110_Text_KalebIntro"
msgid ""
"When cute POKéMON help each other…\n"
"You won't see a more adorable sight!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1228
msgctxt "Route110_Text_KalebDefeated"
msgid "Have you no compassion or pity?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1231
msgctxt "Route110_Text_KalebPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Okay, okay, you've done the best you\n"
"could, my pretties.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1235
msgctxt "Route111_Text_DrewIntro"
msgid ""
"Oh, hey! Those GO-GOGGLES suit you.\n"
"But I think they look better on me.\p"
"Let's decide who they look better on\n"
"with a battle!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1241
msgctxt "Route111_Text_DrewDefeat"
msgid ""
"I couldn't see what was happening at\n"
"my sides because of the GO-GOGGLES.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1245
msgctxt "Route111_Text_DrewPostBattle"
msgid ""
"The GO-GOGGLES make it possible to\n"
"get through sandstorms.\l"
"That makes me happy!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1250
msgctxt "Route111_Text_HeidiIntro"
msgid ""
"I'm having a picnic in the desert.\p"
"You can always find a TRAINER,\n"
"so I can enjoy a battle here, too!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1255
msgctxt "Route111_Text_HeidiDefeat"
msgid "Ohhh! You're mean!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1258
msgctxt "Route111_Text_HeidiPostBattle"
msgid ""
"When you're battling in a sandstorm,\n"
"watch out for your POKéMON's HP.\p"
"It can faint if you don't keep\n"
"an eye on it!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1264
msgctxt "Route111_Text_BeauIntro"
msgid ""
"Wearing these GO-GOGGLES makes me\n"
"feel like a superhero.\l"
"Right now, nobody can beat me!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1269
msgctxt "Route111_Text_BeauDefeat"
msgid "I can't win on spirit alone…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1272
msgctxt "Route111_Text_BeauPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I'm going to be a real hero one day.\n"
"I'm going to work harder to make me\l"
"and my POKéMON stronger.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1277
msgctxt "Route111_Text_BeckyIntro"
msgid ""
"I heard there are fossils to be found\n"
"in the desert. Where could they be?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1281
msgctxt "Route111_Text_BeckyDefeat"
msgid "I came up short…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1284
msgctxt "Route111_Text_BeckyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"If they can find fossils in the desert,\n"
"it must have been a sea before.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1288
msgctxt "Route111_Text_DustyIntro"
msgid ""
"For thirty years I have searched for\n"
"ancient ruins!\l"
"I am to be challenged?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1293
msgctxt "Route111_Text_DustyDefeat"
msgid ""
"While I have searched for ruins,\n"
"I've not searched for strong POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1297
msgctxt "Route111_Text_DustyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"For thirty years I have searched for\n"
"ancient ruins!\p"
"No, wait, was that forty years?\n"
"Which was it now?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1303
msgctxt "Route111_Text_DustyRegister"
msgid ""
"I haven't been searching for any\n"
"tough POKéMON.\p"
"But, for some reason, I sure do like\n"
"POKéNAVS.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1309
msgctxt "Route111_Text_DustyRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"For thirty years I have searched for\n"
"ancient ruins!\p"
"No, wait, was that forty years?\n"
"Anyway, am I to be challenged?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1315
msgctxt "Route111_Text_DustyRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"I've found no ruins, nor have I found\n"
"any strong POKéMON…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1319
msgctxt "Route111_Text_DustyPostRematch"
msgid ""
"For thirty years I have searched for\n"
"ancient ruins!\p"
"No, wait, was that forty years\n"
"I've searched?\p"
"Hmm… It could even be fifty…\n"
"How long have I been at this?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1327
msgctxt "Route111_Text_TravisIntro"
msgid ""
"I'm full of pep!\n"
"And my POKéMON is peppy, too!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1331
msgctxt "Route111_Text_TravisDefeat"
msgid "My POKéMON lost its pep…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1334
msgctxt "Route111_Text_TravisPostBattle"
msgid ""
"When I see a TRAINER with a lot of pep,\n"
"I can't help looking.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1338
msgctxt "Route111_Text_IreneIntro"
msgid ""
"I don't know where you're going,\n"
"but would you like to battle?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1342
msgctxt "Route111_Text_IreneDefeat"
msgid "Oh, you're disgustingly good!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1345
msgctxt "Route111_Text_IrenePostBattle"
msgid ""
"I'm thinking that I should go to\n"
"MT. CHIMNEY, but the view around\l"
"here is very nice, too.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1350
msgctxt "Route111_Text_DaisukeIntro"
msgid ""
"To train myself, I challenge all\n"
"whom I meet!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1354
msgctxt "Route111_Text_DaisukeDefeat"
msgid "Uncle! I give up!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1357
msgctxt "Route111_Text_DaisukePostBattle"
msgid ""
"All I can do is keep training until\n"
"I can defeat strong TRAINERS such\l"
"as yourself.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1362
msgctxt "Route111_Text_WiltonIntro"
msgid ""
"Show me how much you've toughened\n"
"your POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1366
msgctxt "Route111_Text_WiltonDefeat"
msgid ""
"I see, you've toughened them\n"
"considerably.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1370
msgctxt "Route111_Text_WiltonPostBattle"
msgid ""
"POKéMON and TRAINERS learn much\n"
"through battling.\p"
"What's important is to never give up\n"
"even if you lose.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1376
msgctxt "Route111_Text_WiltonRegister"
msgid ""
"There is much to be learned from\n"
"your training style.\p"
"I request a rematch if it\n"
"behooves you.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1382
msgctxt "Route111_Text_WiltonRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"We're training here to elevate our\n"
"game to the next level.\l"
"Stay and train with us!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1387
msgctxt "Route111_Text_WiltonRematchDefeat"
msgid "Ooh, you're decent!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1390
msgctxt "Route111_Text_WiltonPostRematch"
msgid ""
"Since you're that strong, you should\n"
"aim for the POKéMON LEAGUE.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1394
msgctxt "Route111_Text_BrookeIntro"
msgid ""
"Oh, your POKéMON look like serious\n"
"actors.\l"
"I have to ask you for an engagement.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1399
msgctxt "Route111_Text_BrookeDefeat"
msgid ""
"They didn't just look strong,\n"
"they are strong!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1403
msgctxt "Route111_Text_BrookePostBattle"
msgid ""
"I thought I was raising my POKéMON\n"
"diligently, but, oh no, there is still\l"
"much to be done.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1408
msgctxt "Route111_Text_BrookeRegister"
msgid ""
"I wish I could become friends with\n"
"more strong people like you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1412
msgctxt "Route111_Text_BrookeRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"You can make POKéMON stronger or\n"
"weaker depending on the moves you\l"
"teach them.\p"
"What kinds of moves do your POKéMON\n"
"know?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1419
msgctxt "Route111_Text_BrookeRematchDefeat"
msgid "You've taught them good moves!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1422
msgctxt "Route111_Text_BrookePostRematch"
msgid ""
"Maybe I should have stopped my\n"
"POKéMON from evolving until they\l"
"learned better moves…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1427
msgctxt "Route111_Text_CeliaIntro"
msgid ""
"I shouldn't have come to a place like\n"
"this for a picnic!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1431
msgctxt "Route111_Text_CeliaDefeat"
msgid ""
"Aww!\n"
"I really shouldn't have come!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1435
msgctxt "Route111_Text_CeliaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"In a sandstorm like this, I can't set\n"
"the places for a picnic even with my\l"
"GO-GOGGLES on…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1440
msgctxt "Route111_Text_BryanIntro"
msgid ""
"How tough are you?\n"
"We shall expose that secret!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1444
msgctxt "Route111_Text_BryanDefeat"
msgid ""
"Oh! Your strength!\n"
"It is shrouded in mystery!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1448
msgctxt "Route111_Text_BryanPostBattle"
msgid ""
"This desert hoards mysteries in\n"
"its shifting sands!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1452
msgctxt "Route111_Text_BrandenIntro"
msgid ""
"I'll give you some of my sandwich\n"
"if you'll lose.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1456
msgctxt "Route111_Text_BrandenDefeat"
msgid ""
"Tch! I thought a sandwich would be\n"
"enough of a bribe…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1460
msgctxt "Route111_Text_BrandenPostBattle"
msgid ""
"My SANDSHREW loves eating\n"
"my sandwiches.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1464
msgctxt "Route111_Text_TyronIntro"
msgid "This is my favorite kind of POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1467
msgctxt "Route111_Text_TyronDefeat"
msgid ""
"Wait!\n"
"Did you get a good look at my POKéMON?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1471
msgctxt "Route111_Text_TyronPostBattle"
msgid ""
"When having a battle, I get a kick out\n"
"of showing off my POKéMON.\p"
"I bet everyone feels that way when\n"
"they enter a battle!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1477
msgctxt "Route111_Text_CelinaIntro"
msgid ""
"Show me how to put a little excitement\n"
"into my life.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1481
msgctxt "Route111_Text_CelinaDefeat"
msgid ""
"Oh… My…\n"
"That was too much excitement.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1485
msgctxt "Route111_Text_CelinaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"My pulse is still racing.\n"
"You're one fabulous TRAINER.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1489
msgctxt "Route111_Text_HaydenIntro"
msgid ""
"When you're as famished as I am,\n"
"there is no room for pity!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1493
msgctxt "Route111_Text_HaydenDefeat"
msgid "Groan…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1496
msgctxt "Route111_Text_HaydenPostBattle"
msgid ""
"My stomach is grumbling!\n"
"Maybe I can grill some BERRIES…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1500
msgctxt "Route111_Text_BiancaIntro"
msgid ""
"Did you come from MAUVILLE?\n"
"Then you should be full of energy!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1504
msgctxt "Route111_Text_BiancaDefeat"
msgid ""
"Ooh lala!\n"
"That's a lot to take!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1508
msgctxt "Route111_Text_BiancaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"This road here…\n"
"You have quite a ways to travel.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1512
msgctxt "Route112_Text_BriceIntro"
msgid ""
"Hahahaha!\n"
"How about we have a battle?\l"
"You and me!\l"
"Hahahaha!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1518
msgctxt "Route112_Text_BriceDefeat"
msgid ""
"I lost!\n"
"Hahahaha!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1522
msgctxt "Route112_Text_BricePostBattle"
msgid ""
"Hahahahaha! Something flew up my nose!\n"
"Hahahaha-hatchoo!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1526
msgctxt "Route112_Text_TrentIntro"
msgid ""
"My legs are solid from pounding up\n"
"and down the mountains.\p"
"They're not going to buckle easily,\n"
"friend!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1532
msgctxt "Route112_Text_TrentDefeat"
msgid "Ouch! My legs cramped up!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1535
msgctxt "Route112_Text_TrentPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Try hiking, and I mean really\n"
"pounding, on these mountain trails\l"
"with a heavy pack weighing dozens of\l"
"pounds.\p"
"That, my friend, will get your body\n"
"into serious shape.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1543
msgctxt "Route112_Text_TrentRegister"
msgid ""
"Ow, my legs have cramped up.\n"
"Can you grab me some bandages from\l"
"my backpack?\p"
"No, that's my POKéNAV!\n"
"Oh, fine, I'll register you.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1550
msgctxt "Route112_Text_TrentRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"I've been keeping fit by hiking.\n"
"Power, I have in spades!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1554
msgctxt "Route112_Text_TrentRematchDefeat"
msgid "I got trumped in power?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1557
msgctxt "Route112_Text_TrentRematchPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I hear there are some seriously tough\n"
"TRAINERS on top of MT. CHIMNEY.\p"
"I intend to get up there and give them\n"
"a challenge!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1563
msgctxt "Route112_Text_LarryIntro"
msgid ""
"I'm strong.\n"
"I won't cry if I lose.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1567
msgctxt "Route112_Text_LarryDefeat"
msgid "Waaaah!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1570
msgctxt "Route112_Text_LarryPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I'm not crying because I miss my mommy!\n"
"Snivel…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1574
msgctxt "Route112_Text_CarolIntro"
msgid ""
"When you're out on a picnic, why,\n"
"you simply have to sing!\l"
"Come on, sing with me!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1579
msgctxt "Route112_Text_CarolDefeat"
msgid "Oh, you're so strong!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1582
msgctxt "Route112_Text_CarolPostBattle"
msgid ""
"It doesn't matter if you're good or bad\n"
"at singing or POKéMON.\p"
"If you have the most fun, you win!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1587
msgctxt "Route112_Text_BryantIntro"
msgid ""
"I caught hot POKéMON in FIERY PATH!\n"
"Take a look!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1591
msgctxt "Route112_Text_BryantDefeat"
msgid "What a bumpy ride that was!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1594
msgctxt "Route112_Text_BryantPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I like the way you battle.\n"
"It has a certain flair to it.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1598
msgctxt "Route112_Text_ShaylaIntro"
msgid ""
"Oh, aren't you an adorable TRAINER!\n"
"Please, I need a romantic battle!\l"
"I'm somewhat decent!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1603
msgctxt "Route112_Text_ShaylaDefeat"
msgid ""
"Oh, how strong you are!\n"
"You've given me quite a shock!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1607
msgctxt "Route112_Text_ShaylaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Are you busy right now?\n"
"I was thinking that maybe we can have\l"
"a rematch right now…\l"
"But it's all right if you're busy.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1613
msgctxt "Route113_Text_JaylenIntro"
msgid ""
"Can you guess why it's so cool\n"
"around here?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1617
msgctxt "Route113_Text_JaylenDefeat"
msgid ""
"Peeuuw!\n"
"That stinks!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1621
msgctxt "Route113_Text_JaylenPostBattle"
msgid ""
"The volcanic ash blocks the sun,\n"
"so it doesn't get very warm.\p"
"That's good for me--I can't stand heat!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1626
msgctxt "Route113_Text_DillonIntro"
msgid ""
"The volcano's eruption is proof that\n"
"the earth is alive.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1630
msgctxt "Route113_Text_DillonDefeat"
msgid "You're some kind of strong!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1633
msgctxt "Route113_Text_DillonPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Ouch! Owww! I can't see!\n"
"I got ashes in my eyelashes!\p"
"Get it? Ashes and eyelashes?\p"
"Okay, that was bad, sorry…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1639
msgctxt "Route113_Text_MadelineIntro"
msgid ""
"I use this parasol to ward off this\n"
"filthy, yucky volcanic ash from\l"
"my dear NUMEL.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1644
msgctxt "Route113_Text_MadelineDefeat"
msgid ""
"Huff, huff…\n"
"I am exhausted…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1648
msgctxt "Route113_Text_MadelinePostBattle"
msgid ""
"You're very good at this.\n"
"I must say I'm impressed!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1652
msgctxt "Route113_Text_MadelineRegister"
msgid ""
"Here, slide under my parasol.\n"
"Let me register you in my POKéNAV.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1656
msgctxt "Route113_Text_MadelineRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"Oh, hello, hasn't it been a while?\n"
"May I invite you to battle?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1660
msgctxt "Route113_Text_MadelineRematchDefeat"
msgid "Oh, how super!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1663
msgctxt "Route113_Text_MadelinePostRematch"
msgid ""
"You've remained very good at this.\n"
"I must say I'm impressed!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1667
msgctxt "Route113_Text_LaoIntro"
msgid ""
"From out of the ashes I leap! Hiyah!\n"
"I challenge thee!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1671
msgctxt "Route113_Text_LaoDefeat"
msgid "With honor I admit defeat!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1674
msgctxt "Route113_Text_LaoPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I must refine the art of concealment.\n"
"I bid thee farewell.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1678
msgctxt "Route113_Text_LaoRegister"
msgid ""
"Yiiyaah! Witness the ancient ninja\n"
"technique of POKéNAV registration!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1682
msgctxt "Route113_Text_LaoRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"From out of the ashes I leap! Hiyah!\n"
"I challenge thee!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1686
msgctxt "Route113_Text_LaoRematchDefeat"
msgid "With honor I admit defeat!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1689
msgctxt "Route113_Text_LaoPostRematch"
msgid ""
"My flawless concealment was let down\n"
"by my immature battle skills…\p"
"I bid thee farewell.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1694
msgctxt "Route113_Text_LungIntro"
msgid ""
"Thanks for finding me!\n"
"But we still have to battle!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1698
msgctxt "Route113_Text_LungDefeat"
msgid ""
"I'll use my ninjutsu on you…\n"
"“VOLCANIC ASH SWIRL CLOAK”!\p"
"…What?\n"
"It's already over?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1704
msgctxt "Route113_Text_LungPostBattle"
msgid ""
"You know what's crummy about hiding?\n"
"It's lonely if no one comes along.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1708
msgctxt "Route113_Text_ToriIntro"
msgid ""
"TORI: Both of us, we collect ashes.\n"
"We battle POKéMON, too.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1712
msgctxt "Route113_Text_ToriDefeat"
msgid ""
"TORI: We lost… It's boring, so I'm going\n"
"to get some more ashes.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1716
msgctxt "Route113_Text_ToriPostBattle"
msgid ""
"TORI: How much ash do we have?\n"
"Enough for a WHITE FLUTE, I hope.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1720
msgctxt "Route113_Text_ToriNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"TORI: We want to battle 2-on-2.\n"
"If we didn't, we would lose!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1724
msgctxt "Route113_Text_TiaIntro"
msgid ""
"TIA: Both of us, we collect ashes.\n"
"We battle POKéMON, too.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1728
msgctxt "Route113_Text_TiaDefeat"
msgid ""
"TIA: We couldn't win… It's boring,\n"
"so I'm getting some more ashes.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1732
msgctxt "Route113_Text_TiaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"TIA: We have a lot of ashes!\n"
"I think enough for a WHITE FLUTE!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1736
msgctxt "Route113_Text_TiaNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"TIA: We want to battle 2-on-2.\n"
"If we don't, we won't win!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1740
msgctxt "Route113_Text_CobyIntro"
msgid ""
"Pfft, with these wings I can\n"
"flick you away!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1744
msgctxt "Route113_Text_CobyDefeat"
msgid "A… What?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1747
msgctxt "Route113_Text_CobyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I don't know what to say when I get\n"
"beaten so easily…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1751
msgctxt "Route113_Text_SophieIntro"
msgid ""
"The warmth here is making me drowsy.\n"
"Battle with me so I can stay awake.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1755
msgctxt "Route113_Text_SophieDefeat"
msgid ""
"This is a dream.\n"
"I'm sure of it…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1759
msgctxt "Route113_Text_SophiePostBattle"
msgid ""
"Losing burns me up…\n"
"I'm just going to sleep right here!\l"
"Zzz!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1764
msgctxt "Route113_Text_LawrenceIntro"
msgid ""
"Were you maybe in the middle\n"
"of gathering volcanic ashes?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1768
msgctxt "Route113_Text_LawrenceDefeat"
msgid ""
"Ehehe.\n"
"We got beaten cleanly.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1772
msgctxt "Route113_Text_LawrencePostBattle"
msgid "I ought to hide under the ashes, too.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1775
msgctxt "Route113_Text_WyattIntro"
msgid ""
"Y-you want to battle with me?\n"
"Even though I just caught my POKéMON?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1779
msgctxt "Route113_Text_WyattDefeat"
msgid ""
"Y-you're all happy to win?\n"
"Even though it's only me?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1783
msgctxt "Route113_Text_WyattPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Oh, so now you want to say a word to\n"
"the loser?\p"
"Aren't you just the coolest?\n"
"Humph!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1789
msgctxt "Route114_Text_LennyIntro"
msgid ""
"Yodelayhihoo!\p"
"… …\p"
"You're supposed to shout\n"
"“yodelayhihoo” since it doesn't\l"
"echo here!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1796
msgctxt "Route114_Text_LennyDefeat"
msgid "Yodelayhihoo!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1799
msgctxt "Route114_Text_LennyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"When I was a wee tyke, I believed there\n"
"was someone copying me and shouting\l"
"back, “Yodelayhihoo.”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1804
msgctxt "Route114_Text_LucasIntro"
msgid ""
"If you're not prepared, you shouldn't\n"
"be up in the mountains!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1808
msgctxt "Route114_Text_LucasDefeat"
msgid "The mountains are unforgiving…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1811
msgctxt "Route114_Text_LucasPostBattle"
msgid ""
"In the winter, mountains turn deadly\n"
"with blizzards and avalanches.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1815
msgctxt "Route114_Text_ShaneIntro"
msgid ""
"Camping's fun! You can fish, roast\n"
"marshmallows, and tell spooky stories!\p"
"But the best of all are the POKéMON\n"
"battles!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1821
msgctxt "Route114_Text_ShaneDefeat"
msgid "Way too strong!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1824
msgctxt "Route114_Text_ShanePostBattle"
msgid ""
"I think it's great that I can go\n"
"camping with my POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1828
msgctxt "Route114_Text_NancyIntro"
msgid ""
"I need to exercise after a meal.\n"
"Let's have a match!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1832
msgctxt "Route114_Text_NancyDefeat"
msgid "Oh, no!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1835
msgctxt "Route114_Text_NancyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I just had a tasty meal.\n"
"I'm getting drowsy…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1839
msgctxt "Route114_Text_SteveIntro"
msgid ""
"Ufufufufufu…\n"
"Want to battle against my POKéMON?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1843
msgctxt "Route114_Text_SteveDefeat"
msgid "M-My POKéMON…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1846
msgctxt "Route114_Text_StevePostBattle"
msgid ""
"A big body that's all lumpy and hard,\n"
"enormous horns, and vicious fangs…\p"
"Ufufufufu…\n"
"I wish I had a POKéMON like that…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1852
msgctxt "Route114_Text_SteveRegister"
msgid ""
"Don't forget what you've done to me!\n"
"I'll make it so you can't forget!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1856
msgctxt "Route114_Text_SteveRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"Ufufufufufu…\n"
"Come on, battle my POKéMON…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1860
msgctxt "Route114_Text_SteveRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"I feel so lucky getting to see your\n"
"POKéMON…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1864
msgctxt "Route114_Text_StevePostRematch"
msgid ""
"Ufufufufufu…\p"
"When I see POKéMON battling, I get all\n"
"shivery and shaky…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1869
msgctxt "Route114_Text_BernieIntro"
msgid ""
"If you're lighting a campfire,\n"
"make sure you have water handy.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1873
msgctxt "Route114_Text_BernieDefeat"
msgid "Thanks for dousing my fire!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1876
msgctxt "Route114_Text_BerniePostBattle"
msgid ""
"You really do have to be careful with\n"
"any sort of fire in a forest.\p"
"Don't ever underestimate the power\n"
"of fire.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1882
msgctxt "Route114_Text_BernieRegister"
msgid ""
"You set my spirit on fire.\n"
"Let's register each other!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1886
msgctxt "Route114_Text_BernieRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"Have you learned to keep water handy\n"
"for campfires?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1890
msgctxt "Route114_Text_BernieRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"I got hosed down before I could\n"
"flare up, I guess.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1894
msgctxt "Route114_Text_BerniePostRematch"
msgid ""
"You really do have to be careful with\n"
"any sort of fire in a forest.\p"
"Don't ever underestimate the power\n"
"of fire.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1900
msgctxt "Route114_Text_ClaudeIntro"
msgid ""
"If we were fishing, you wouldn't stand\n"
"a chance against me.\l"
"So, bring on your POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1905
msgctxt "Route114_Text_ClaudeDefeat"
msgid "If we were fishing, I would've won…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1908
msgctxt "Route114_Text_ClaudePostBattle"
msgid ""
"I think I'll try my luck at landing\n"
"a big one at METEOR FALLS.\p"
"There has to be something in there.\n"
"I just know it.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1914
msgctxt "Route114_Text_NolanIntro"
msgid ""
"I like to fish. But I also like to\n"
"battle!\p"
"If anyone challenges me, I'm there,\n"
"even if I'm fishing.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1920
msgctxt "Route114_Text_NolanDefeat"
msgid ""
"I like to battle, but that doesn't\n"
"mean I'm good at it…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1924
msgctxt "Route114_Text_NolanPostBattle"
msgid ""
"This time I'll do it!\p"
"I always think that, so I can't walk\n"
"away from fishing or POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1929
msgctxt "Route114_Text_TyraIntro"
msgid ""
"TYRA: Well, sure.\n"
"I'm in the mood for it.\l"
"I'll teach you a little about POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1934
msgctxt "Route114_Text_TyraDefeat"
msgid "TYRA: What an amazing battle style!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1937
msgctxt "Route114_Text_TyraPostBattle"
msgid ""
"TYRA: I was teaching my junior IVY\n"
"about POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1941
msgctxt "Route114_Text_TyraNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"TYRA: Giggle…\n"
"If you want to battle with us, just one\l"
"POKéMON isn't enough!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1946
msgctxt "Route114_Text_IvyIntro"
msgid "IVY: Who taught you about POKéMON?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1949
msgctxt "Route114_Text_IvyDefeat"
msgid "IVY: What an amazing battle style!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1952
msgctxt "Route114_Text_IvyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"IVY: I started training POKéMON\n"
"because TYRA, my student mentor,\l"
"taught me!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1957
msgctxt "Route114_Text_IvyNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"IVY: Do you only have one POKéMON?\n"
"I think it must feel lonesome.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1961
msgctxt "Route114_Text_KaiIntro"
msgid ""
"I landed a big one!\n"
"A huge one, I tell you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1965
msgctxt "Route114_Text_KaiDefeat"
msgid ""
"What was that about?\n"
"Did mine lose in size?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1969
msgctxt "Route114_Text_KaiPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Okay!\n"
"I'll just fish me a bigger one!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1973
msgctxt "Route114_Text_CharlotteIntro"
msgid ""
"Me!\n"
"I'm not just a pretty face!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1977
msgctxt "Route114_Text_CharlotteDefeat"
msgid "That wasn't cute in the least!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1980
msgctxt "Route114_Text_CharlottePostBattle"
msgid ""
"I don't want a POKéMON that's\n"
"just cute.\p"
"I adore cute ones that have a quirk\n"
"or two!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1986
msgctxt "Route114_Text_AngelinaIntro"
msgid ""
"Have you made your POKéMON evolve\n"
"very much?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1990
msgctxt "Route114_Text_AngelinaDefeat"
msgid ""
"Oh, I see.\n"
"That's good to know.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1994
msgctxt "Route114_Text_AngelinaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Some POKéMON change so much when\n"
"they evolve, it's startling!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:1998
msgctxt "Route115_Text_TimothyIntro"
msgid ""
"Hm…\n"
"You seem rather capable…\l"
"Let me keep you company!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2003
msgctxt "Route115_Text_TimothyDefeat"
msgid ""
"You're much stronger than\n"
"I'd imagined!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2007
msgctxt "Route115_Text_TimothyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"There is no such thing as a born genius.\n"
"It all depends on effort!\l"
"That is what I believe…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2012
msgctxt "Route115_Text_TimothyRegister"
msgid ""
"Hmm… A loss this thorough has been\n"
"a distant memory.\p"
"If you would allow it, I wish for\n"
"another opportunity to do battle.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2018
msgctxt "Route115_Text_TimothyRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"Hm… As always, your agility speaks\n"
"for itself.\l"
"Come, keep me company!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2023
msgctxt "Route115_Text_TimothyRematchDefeat"
msgid "As strong as ever!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2026
msgctxt "Route115_Text_TimothyPostRematch"
msgid ""
"All it takes is effort!\p"
"I lost because I haven't put in enough\n"
"effort!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2031
msgctxt "Route115_Text_KoichiIntro"
msgid ""
"You!\p"
"My MACHOP!\p"
"Demand a battle!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2036
msgctxt "Route115_Text_KoichiDefeat"
msgid "Ouch, ouch, ouch!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2039
msgctxt "Route115_Text_KoichiPostBattle"
msgid ""
"My MACHOP crew!\p"
"So long as they seek power, I will\n"
"grow strong with them!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2044
msgctxt "Route115_Text_NobIntro"
msgid ""
"My strongest skill is busting bricks\n"
"with my forehead!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2048
msgctxt "Route115_Text_NobDefeat"
msgid ""
"Ugwaaaah!\n"
"My head is busted!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2052
msgctxt "Route115_Text_NobPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I've been teaching my POKéMON karate.\p"
"It looks like they'll get a lot better\n"
"than me. I'm excited about that.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2057
msgctxt "Route115_Text_NobRegister"
msgid ""
"You impress me! Give me a rematch\n"
"after I redo my training!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2061
msgctxt "Route115_Text_NobRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"After you beat me, we trained hard to\n"
"improve our skills.\l"
"Come on, give us a rematch!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2066
msgctxt "Route115_Text_NobRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"Ugwaaah!\n"
"We lost again!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2070
msgctxt "Route115_Text_NobPostRematch"
msgid ""
"My POKéMON will grow stronger!\n"
"I'll redouble my training!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2074
msgctxt "Route115_Text_CyndyIntro"
msgid ""
"This beach is my secret training spot!\n"
"Don't come butting in!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2078
msgctxt "Route115_Text_CyndyDefeat"
msgid "I haven't trained enough!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2081
msgctxt "Route115_Text_CyndyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"The sand acts as a cushion to reduce\n"
"impact and prevent injury.\l"
"This is the perfect place to train.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2086
msgctxt "Route115_Text_CyndyRegister"
msgid ""
"Okay, fine, you're free to come here.\n"
"In return, I'd like to battle you again.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2090
msgctxt "Route115_Text_CyndyRematchIntro"
msgid "Okay, let's get this battle on!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2093
msgctxt "Route115_Text_CyndyRematchDefeat"
msgid "I can battle but my POKéMON…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2096
msgctxt "Route115_Text_CyndyPostRematch"
msgid ""
"Even when I lose, I still get some\n"
"enjoyment out of it.\l"
"It must be that I love POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2101
msgctxt "Route115_Text_HectorIntro"
msgid ""
"I have a rare POKéMON!\n"
"Would you like me to show you?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2105
msgctxt "Route115_Text_HectorDefeat"
msgid ""
"You…\n"
"You want my POKéMON, don't you?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2109
msgctxt "Route115_Text_HectorPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I have this rare POKéMON.\n"
"It's enough to keep me satisfied.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2113
msgctxt "Route115_Text_KyraIntro"
msgid ""
"I'll battle while I'm running!\n"
"Try to keep up with me!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2117
msgctxt "Route115_Text_KyraDefeat"
msgid "Gasp, gasp…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2120
msgctxt "Route115_Text_KyraPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I made the mistake of trying to battle\n"
"while running!\p"
"I should take a run to calm down…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2125
msgctxt "Route115_Text_JaidenIntro"
msgid ""
"Take that!\n"
"Ultra POKéMON ninja attack!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2129
msgctxt "Route115_Text_JaidenDefeat"
msgid ""
"Waaah!\n"
"Our strategy failed!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2133
msgctxt "Route115_Text_JaidenPostBattle"
msgid ""
"But my POKéMON were ultra,\n"
"weren't they?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2137
msgctxt "Route115_Text_HeleneIntro"
msgid ""
"My POKéMON have black belt-level\n"
"strength!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2141
msgctxt "Route115_Text_HeleneDefeat"
msgid "This is too humiliating!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2144
msgctxt "Route115_Text_HelenePostBattle"
msgid ""
"I rarely meet anyone who's better\n"
"than me…\p"
"I get it now!\n"
"You're a GYM LEADER, aren't you?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2150
msgctxt "Route115_Text_AlixIntro"
msgid ""
"Our eyes met!\n"
"There's no getting away now!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2154
msgctxt "Route115_Text_AlixDefeat"
msgid ""
"Gah!\n"
"Not bad!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2158
msgctxt "Route115_Text_AlixPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Oh, well.\n"
"I think I will TELEPORT home.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2162
msgctxt "Route115_Text_MarleneIntro"
msgid ""
"You've disturbed my meditation…\n"
"You'll be punished for it.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2166
msgctxt "Route115_Text_MarleneDefeat"
msgid "You've broken my concentration!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2169
msgctxt "Route115_Text_MarlenePostBattle"
msgid ""
"I was meditating with my POKéMON.\n"
"But this place isn't very peaceful…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2173
msgctxt "Route116_Text_ClarkIntro"
msgid ""
"If the tunnel doesn't go through, then\n"
"I'll just go over the top.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2177
msgctxt "Route116_Text_ClarkDefeat"
msgid ""
"Gasp… Gasp…\n"
"Losing made me tired…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2181
msgctxt "Route116_Text_ClarkPostBattle"
msgid ""
"It's no big deal if there's no tunnel.\n"
"To a HIKER, mountains are roads!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2185
msgctxt "Route116_Text_JoeyIntro"
msgid ""
"My POKéMON rule!\n"
"Check them out!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2189
msgctxt "Route116_Text_JoeyDefeat"
msgid ""
"Ouch! A scrape!\n"
"I have to put on a bandage!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2193
msgctxt "Route116_Text_JoeyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Bandages are signs of toughness!\n"
"I've got another one!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2197
msgctxt "Route116_Text_JoseIntro"
msgid ""
"My BUG POKéMON are tough!\n"
"Let's battle!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2201
msgctxt "Route116_Text_JoseDefeat"
msgid ""
"I lost!\n"
"I thought I had you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2205
msgctxt "Route116_Text_JosePostBattle"
msgid ""
"BUG POKéMON evolve quickly.\n"
"So they get strong quickly, too.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2209
msgctxt "Route116_Text_JaniceIntro"
msgid ""
"Let me teach you how strong my\n"
"adorable POKéMON is!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2213
msgctxt "Route116_Text_JaniceDefeat"
msgid "You're a notch above me…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2216
msgctxt "Route116_Text_JanicePostBattle"
msgid ""
"POKéMON that possess cuteness and\n"
"power, that's ideal, I think.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2220
msgctxt "Route116_Text_JerryIntro"
msgid ""
"We learn all sorts of things at the\n"
"TRAINER'S SCHOOL.\p"
"I want to test things out for real!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2225
msgctxt "Route116_Text_JerryDefeat"
msgid ""
"I slacked off in school…\n"
"That's why I lost.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2229
msgctxt "Route116_Text_JerryPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I'll have to redo some courses at\n"
"the TRAINER'S SCHOOL.\l"
"If I don't, ROXANNE will be steamed.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2234
msgctxt "Route116_Text_JerryRegister1"
msgid ""
"I learned at the TRAINER'S SCHOOL\n"
"that a POKéNAV can register TRAINERS.\p"
"I don't really get what that means,\n"
"so can I just try it?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2240
msgctxt "Route116_Text_JerryRegister2"
msgid ""
"I learned at the TRAINER'S SCHOOL\n"
"that a POKéNAV can register TRAINERS.\p"
"I don't really get what that means,\n"
"so can I just try it?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2246
msgctxt "Route116_Text_JerryRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"I've been studying seriously at the\n"
"TRAINER'S SCHOOL.\l"
"I won't lose like I did last time.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2251
msgctxt "Route116_Text_JerryRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"Hunh?\n"
"I studied diligently.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2255
msgctxt "Route116_Text_JerryPostRematch"
msgid ""
"I'll have to redo some courses at\n"
"the TRAINER'S SCHOOL.\l"
"If I don't, ROXANNE will be steamed.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2260
msgctxt "Route116_Text_KarenIntro"
msgid ""
"I study at school, and I study on\n"
"the way home, too!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2264
msgctxt "Route116_Text_KarenDefeat"
msgid "I'm in shock--I lost?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2267
msgctxt "Route116_Text_KarenPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Awww, I'll never become an elegant\n"
"TRAINER like ROXANNE this way!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2271
msgctxt "Route116_Text_KarenRegister1"
msgid ""
"Oh, wow! Isn't that a POKéNAV?\n"
"I have one, too! Please register me!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2275
msgctxt "Route116_Text_KarenRegister2"
msgid ""
"Oh, wow! Isn't that a POKéNAV?\n"
"I have one, too! Please register me!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2279
msgctxt "Route116_Text_KarenRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"I studied a whole lot since I saw you.\n"
"You must see my achievements!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2283
msgctxt "Route116_Text_KarenRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"I'm in shock.\n"
"I lost again?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2287
msgctxt "Route116_Text_KarenPostRematch"
msgid ""
"You've beaten ROXANNE?\n"
"I can't beat you, then. Not yet.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2291
msgctxt "Route116_Text_SarahIntro"
msgid ""
"Just so you know, I've never once been\n"
"bested by anyone at anything.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2295
msgctxt "Route116_Text_SarahDefeat"
msgid ""
"Oh, my goodness.\n"
"This is a new experience for me.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2299
msgctxt "Route116_Text_SarahPostBattle"
msgid ""
"My life of luxury affords me all that\n"
"I could possibly desire.\p"
"However, when it comes to POKéMON,\n"
"my wealth has no meaning.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2305
msgctxt "Route116_Text_DawsonIntro"
msgid ""
"When you lay your eyes on my POKéMON's\n"
"gorgeous fur, their beauty will render\l"
"you helpless!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2310
msgctxt "Route116_Text_DawsonDefeat"
msgid "Oh, baby, say it isn't so!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2313
msgctxt "Route116_Text_DawsonPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Oh, no, no, no!\n"
"You've mussed up my POKéMON's fur!\l"
"You've ruined my hairdo, too!\l"
"I'll have to call my stylist now!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2319
msgctxt "Route116_Text_DevanIntro"
msgid "We'll rock you hard!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2322
msgctxt "Route116_Text_DevanDefeat"
msgid ""
"Aiyiyi!\n"
"No contest at all!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2326
msgctxt "Route116_Text_DevanPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I should try different POKéMON\n"
"types, that's what I ought to do.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2330
msgctxt "Route116_Text_JohnsonIntro"
msgid ""
"It's a dead end up here.\n"
"I'm bored, so can we battle?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2334
msgctxt "Route116_Text_JohnsonDefeat"
msgid "That was fun even though I lost.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2337
msgctxt "Route116_Text_JohnsonPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Want to stay here and keep\n"
"me company?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2341
msgctxt "Route117_Text_IsaacIntro"
msgid ""
"Listen, could I get you to battle\n"
"the POKéMON I'm raising?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2345
msgctxt "Route117_Text_IsaacDefeat"
msgid "You've raised yours superbly…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2348
msgctxt "Route117_Text_IsaacPostBattle"
msgid ""
"POKéMON isn't all about power.\p"
"Polishing a unique aspect of one's\n"
"character is another way of enjoying\l"
"POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2354
msgctxt "Route117_Text_IsaacRegister"
msgid ""
"I'm going to redouble my training.\n"
"Would you come look in on us?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2358
msgctxt "Route117_Text_IsaacRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"The POKéMON I've been raising are\n"
"looking good, just like before.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2362
msgctxt "Route117_Text_IsaacRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"You know how to raise them properly.\n"
"You might have DAY CARE skills…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2366
msgctxt "Route117_Text_IsaacPostRematch"
msgid ""
"Your POKéMON are growing good!\n"
"You should enter them in CONTESTS.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2370
msgctxt "Route117_Text_LydiaIntro"
msgid ""
"Please, allow me to evaluate if you\n"
"have raised your POKéMON properly.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2374
msgctxt "Route117_Text_LydiaDefeat"
msgid "Yes, they are growing properly.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2377
msgctxt "Route117_Text_LydiaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Try raising POKéMON with more\n"
"attention to their character traits.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2381
msgctxt "Route117_Text_LydiaRegister"
msgid ""
"I'm glad I met a superb TRAINER in you.\n"
"I hope to see you again.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2385
msgctxt "Route117_Text_LydiaRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"Allow me to reevaluate if you have\n"
"raised your POKéMON properly.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2389
msgctxt "Route117_Text_LydiaRematchDefeat"
msgid "They are growing admirably.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2392
msgctxt "Route117_Text_LydiaPostRematch"
msgid ""
"POKéMON seem to like different kinds\n"
"of {POKEBLOCK}S, depending on their nature.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2396
msgctxt "Route117_Text_DylanIntro"
msgid ""
"I'm in the middle of a triathlon, but,\n"
"whatever, let's have a battle!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2400
msgctxt "Route117_Text_DylanDefeat"
msgid "I ran out of energy!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2403
msgctxt "Route117_Text_DylanPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I may have blown it…\p"
"I might have dropped to last during\n"
"that battle…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2408
msgctxt "Route117_Text_DylanRegister"
msgid ""
"POKéMON have to be strong, too?\n"
"I'd like you to train me!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2412
msgctxt "Route117_Text_DylanRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"I'm smack in the middle of a triathlon,\n"
"but I'm comfortably ahead.\l"
"Let's make this a quick battle!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2417
msgctxt "Route117_Text_DylanRematchDefeat"
msgid "I ran out of energy again!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2420
msgctxt "Route117_Text_DylanPostRematch"
msgid ""
"I was tops in swimming and cycling,\n"
"but I'm not quite that confident with\l"
"POKéMON yet.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2425
msgctxt "Route117_Text_MariaIntro"
msgid ""
"I do my triathlon training with POKéMON,\n"
"so I'm pretty confident about my speed.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2429
msgctxt "Route117_Text_MariaDefeat"
msgid ""
"I need to get more practices in,\n"
"I guess.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2433
msgctxt "Route117_Text_MariaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Training is meaningful only if you\n"
"keep it up regularly.\p"
"Okay! I'll resume my training!\n"
"Tomorrow!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2439
msgctxt "Route117_Text_MariaRegister"
msgid ""
"You appear to be training properly…\n"
"If you'd like, I'll battle you later!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2443
msgctxt "Route117_Text_MariaRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"Are you keeping up with your training?\n"
"I sure am!\l"
"Let me show you the evidence!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2448
msgctxt "Route117_Text_MariaRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"I need to get more practices in,\n"
"I guess.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2452
msgctxt "Route117_Text_MariaPostRematch"
msgid ""
"I'll resume training tomorrow.\n"
"Let's battle again sometime!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2456
msgctxt "Route117_Text_DerekIntro"
msgid ""
"Once a BUG CATCHER!\n"
"And now a BUG MANIAC!\p"
"But my love for POKéMON remains\n"
"unchanged!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2462
msgctxt "Route117_Text_DerekDefeat"
msgid ""
"My ineptitude also remains\n"
"unchanged…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2466
msgctxt "Route117_Text_DerekPostBattle"
msgid ""
"All I did was follow my heart, and now\n"
"they call me a BUG MANIAC…\p"
"Still, I am an expert on BUG POKéMON,\n"
"so it's only natural that they call me\l"
"a BUG MANIAC.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2473
msgctxt "Route117_Text_AnnaIntro"
msgid ""
"ANNA: I'm with my pretty junior student\n"
"partner. I have to do good!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2477
msgctxt "Route117_Text_AnnaDefeat"
msgid ""
"ANNA: I'm with my pretty junior student\n"
"partner! Let me win!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2481
msgctxt "Route117_Text_AnnaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"ANNA: Your POKéMON have some good\n"
"combinations.\p"
"I'd say you're second only to us!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2486
msgctxt "Route117_Text_AnnaAndMegRegister"
msgid ""
"ANNA: We can't take this lying down!\n"
"You will come back, won't you?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2490
msgctxt "Route117_Text_AnnaNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"ANNA: If you want to battle us,\n"
"bring two POKéMON with you.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2494
msgctxt "Route117_Text_MegIntro"
msgid ""
"MEG: I'm going to tag up with my super\n"
"senior student partner and beat you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2498
msgctxt "Route117_Text_MegDefeat"
msgid ""
"MEG: Oh, no!\n"
"I'm sorry, ANNA! I let you down…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2502
msgctxt "Route117_Text_MegPostBattle"
msgid ""
"MEG: I dragged ANNA down…\n"
"If I didn't, she would have won!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2506
msgctxt "Route117_Text_MegNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"MEG: Do you only have one POKéMON?\n"
"We can't battle with you, then.\p"
"We want to have a 2-on-2 battle.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2511
msgctxt "Route117_Text_AnnaRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"ANNA: I can't keep losing in front of\n"
"my junior partner, right?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2515
msgctxt "Route117_Text_AnnaRematchDefeat"
msgid "ANNA: I couldn't get into the groove.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2518
msgctxt "Route117_Text_AnnaPostRematch"
msgid ""
"ANNA: Your POKéMON have some good\n"
"combinations.\p"
"I'd say you're second only to us!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2523
msgctxt "Route117_Text_AnnaRematchNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"ANNA: If you want to battle us,\n"
"bring two POKéMON with you.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2527
msgctxt "Route117_Text_MegRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"MEG: I'm going to tag up with my\n"
"senior partner and win this time!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2531
msgctxt "Route117_Text_MegRematchDefeat"
msgid "MEG: Too strong!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2534
msgctxt "Route117_Text_MegPostRematch"
msgid ""
"MEG: I battled together with my\n"
"senior partner, but we lost…\p"
"That's so discouraging…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2539
msgctxt "Route117_Text_MegRematchNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"MEG: Do you only have one POKéMON?\n"
"We can't battle with you, then.\p"
"We want to have a 2-on-2 battle.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2544
msgctxt "Route117_Text_MelinaIntro"
msgid ""
"Isn't it nice? To battle while looking\n"
"at pretty flowers?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2548
msgctxt "Route117_Text_MelinaDefeat"
msgid "Oh, that's quite impressive!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2551
msgctxt "Route117_Text_MelinaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"It feels wonderful to go for a jog\n"
"while looking at flowers.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2555
msgctxt "Route117_Text_BrandiIntro"
msgid ""
"Let me demonstrate the power\n"
"hidden within a PSYCHIC POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2559
msgctxt "Route117_Text_BrandiDefeat"
msgid "Astonishing!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2562
msgctxt "Route117_Text_BrandiPostBattle"
msgid ""
"PSYCHIC POKéMON are complex.\n"
"You should try catching some.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2566
msgctxt "Route117_Text_AishaIntro"
msgid ""
"Concentrate on getting the win.\n"
"That's how I battle!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2570
msgctxt "Route117_Text_AishaDefeat"
msgid ""
"I don't waste any time being angry\n"
"over a loss--I would rather train.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2574
msgctxt "Route117_Text_AishaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I think that if you worry about losing,\n"
"you're more likely to lose.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2578
msgctxt "Route118_Text_RoseIntro"
msgid ""
"The aroma of flowers has a magical\n"
"power. It cleanses us body and soul.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2582
msgctxt "Route118_Text_RoseDefeat"
msgid ""
"Oh, dear me.\n"
"I seem to have lost.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2586
msgctxt "Route118_Text_RosePostBattle"
msgid ""
"Flowers, POKéMON…\n"
"I love whatever smells nice.\p"
"Stinky things…\n"
"I'll pass.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2592
msgctxt "Route118_Text_RoseRegister"
msgid ""
"Sniff… That odor--it's a POKéNAV!\n"
"We must register each other!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2596
msgctxt "Route118_Text_RoseRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"Were you drawn here by the sweet\n"
"aroma?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2600
msgctxt "Route118_Text_RoseRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"The power of aroma…\n"
"It didn't seem to do much.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2604
msgctxt "Route118_Text_RosePostRematch"
msgid ""
"If you use a sweet aroma properly,\n"
"POKéMON will be attracted by it.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2608
msgctxt "Route118_Text_PerryIntro"
msgid ""
"BIRD POKéMON that FLY elegantly in\n"
"the sky… They're the best!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2612
msgctxt "Route118_Text_PerryDefeat"
msgid ""
"Urgh…\n"
"I crashed…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2616
msgctxt "Route118_Text_PerryPostBattle"
msgid ""
"You've got great POKéMON.\n"
"I'll have to train mine better.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2620
msgctxt "Route118_Text_ChesterIntro"
msgid ""
"Take flight!\n"
"My BIRD POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2624
msgctxt "Route118_Text_ChesterDefeat"
msgid "They did take flight…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2627
msgctxt "Route118_Text_ChesterPostBattle"
msgid ""
"If they'd get stronger, they'd be able\n"
"to fly more freely…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2631
msgctxt "Route118_Text_BarnyIntro"
msgid ""
"I'm a FISHERMAN, but also a TRAINER.\n"
"I'm raising the POKéMON I caught.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2635
msgctxt "Route118_Text_BarnyDefeat"
msgid ""
"I thought I was doing okay in my\n"
"training…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2639
msgctxt "Route118_Text_BarnyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I couldn't win by training POKéMON\n"
"while I fished…\p"
"Was I doing things in half measures?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2644
msgctxt "Route118_Text_WadeIntro"
msgid ""
"For FISHERMEN, equipment is the key.\p"
"But for TRAINERS, the key ingredients\n"
"are POKéMON and heart, of course!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2649
msgctxt "Route118_Text_WadeDefeat"
msgid "I was beaten in heart?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2652
msgctxt "Route118_Text_WadePostBattle"
msgid ""
"Come to think of it, fishing is a battle\n"
"between a FISHERMAN and a POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2656
msgctxt "Route118_Text_DaltonIntro"
msgid "Let my melody rock your soul!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2659
msgctxt "Route118_Text_DaltonDefeat"
msgid "La-lalala…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2662
msgctxt "Route118_Text_DaltonPostBattle"
msgid ""
"An electric guitar doesn't always\n"
"have to be noisy…\p"
"It can be strummed to squeeze out\n"
"this heart-stirring melody…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2668
msgctxt "Route118_Text_DaltonRegister"
msgid ""
"When I compose better melodies,\n"
"you have to come listen, okay?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2672
msgctxt "Route118_Text_DaltonRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"A melody from my POKéMON and me…\n"
"Let us deliver it to your soul.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2676
msgctxt "Route118_Text_DaltonRematchDefeat"
msgid "La-lalala…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2679
msgctxt "Route118_Text_DaltonPostRematch"
msgid ""
"When I play, my emotions should reach\n"
"you through my electric guitar…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2683
msgctxt "Route118_Text_DeandreIntro"
msgid ""
"Go, go, go!\n"
"POKéMON 1, 2, and 3!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2687
msgctxt "Route118_Text_DeandreDefeat"
msgid ""
"Come in, POKéMON! Are you okay?\n"
"POKéMON 1, 2, and 3?!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2691
msgctxt "Route118_Text_DeandrePostBattle"
msgid ""
"Isn't it cool that I have a POKéMON\n"
"battle team?\p"
"You can copy me--I don't mind!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2696
msgctxt "Route119_Text_BrentIntro"
msgid ""
"We're the MIMIC CIRCLE!\n"
"We MIMIC what you do!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2700
msgctxt "Route119_Text_BrentDefeat"
msgid ""
"Whoopsie!\n"
"I lost!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2704
msgctxt "Route119_Text_BrentPostBattle"
msgid ""
"What's so good about mimicry?\p"
"Fufufu…\n"
"You'll never understand…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2709
msgctxt "Route119_Text_DonaldIntro"
msgid ""
"So, we finally meet!\n"
"My BUG POKéMON will keep you company!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2713
msgctxt "Route119_Text_DonaldDefeat"
msgid "I wish we'd never met…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2716
msgctxt "Route119_Text_DonaldPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I want to MIMIC you some more.\n"
"Can you hurry up and move?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2720
msgctxt "Route119_Text_TaylorIntro"
msgid ""
"If you step forward, we step forward.\p"
"If you turn right, we turn, too…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2724
msgctxt "Route119_Text_TaylorDefeat"
msgid "But if you win, I lose…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2727
msgctxt "Route119_Text_TaylorPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I can't MIMIC you winning the match.\n"
"That's just impossible…\l"
"It's burning me up…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2732
msgctxt "Route119_Text_DougIntro"
msgid ""
"Yep, you've finally caught me!\n"
"Or were you trying to avoid me?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2736
msgctxt "Route119_Text_DougDefeat"
msgid "Whoop, that was a great match!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2739
msgctxt "Route119_Text_DougPostBattle"
msgid ""
"We're the MIMIC CIRCLE!\n"
"I hope you enjoyed our performance.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2743
msgctxt "Route119_Text_GregIntro"
msgid ""
"You don't know who I am, do you?\p"
"But, I also don't know you.\n"
"So, we'll battle!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2748
msgctxt "Route119_Text_GregDefeat"
msgid "You're pretty strong!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2751
msgctxt "Route119_Text_GregPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Until you go away somewhere, we'll\n"
"keep on mimicking your every move.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2755
msgctxt "Route119_Text_KentIntro"
msgid ""
"The MIMIC CIRCLE was formed by people\n"
"who like to MIMIC.\p"
"A battle starts the instant we meet!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2760
msgctxt "Route119_Text_KentDefeat"
msgid "I give up!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2763
msgctxt "Route119_Text_KentPostBattle"
msgid "Won't you join our MIMIC CIRCLE?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2766
msgctxt "Route119_Text_JacksonIntro"
msgid ""
"Who has the knowledge and\n"
"the technique for survival?\p"
"POKéMON RANGERS, that's who!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2771
msgctxt "Route119_Text_JacksonDefeat"
msgid ""
"I didn't have enough POKéMON\n"
"know-how…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2775
msgctxt "Route119_Text_JacksonPostBattle"
msgid ""
"To break away from civilization and\n"
"awaken the wild spirit within!\p"
"That's our vision.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2780
msgctxt "Route119_Text_JacksonRegister"
msgid ""
"I hope you'll give me a rematch without\n"
"mocking my lack of knowledge.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2784
msgctxt "Route119_Text_JacksonRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"I'm going to regain my wild spirit by\n"
"being together with POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2788
msgctxt "Route119_Text_JacksonRematchDefeat"
msgid "You've remained strong!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2791
msgctxt "Route119_Text_JacksonPostRematch"
msgid ""
"Believe in your POKéMON.\n"
"Believe in yourself.\p"
"The road will reveal itself to you.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2796
msgctxt "Route119_Text_CatherineIntro"
msgid ""
"Oh? Look at you.\p"
"For someone on an adventure,\n"
"you're traveling awfully light.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2801
msgctxt "Route119_Text_CatherineDefeat"
msgid ""
"Accidents happen when you're not\n"
"prepared!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2805
msgctxt "Route119_Text_CatherinePostBattle"
msgid ""
"You're traveling light but you have\n"
"everything you need.\p"
"You're on top of things mentally and\n"
"physically, too.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2811
msgctxt "Route119_Text_CatherineRegister"
msgid ""
"Do you have a POKéNAV?\n"
"It's a must-have tool for any TRAINER.\p"
"Oh, you do have one!\n"
"Let's register each other, then!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2817
msgctxt "Route119_Text_CatherineRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"How's your journey with POKéMON\n"
"going?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2821
msgctxt "Route119_Text_CatherineRematchDefeat"
msgid "I'm still missing something…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2824
msgctxt "Route119_Text_CatherinePostRematch"
msgid ""
"In the same way that you, as a TRAINER,\n"
"rely on your POKéMON, your POKéMON\l"
"rely on you.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2829
msgctxt "Route119_Text_HughIntro"
msgid ""
"The vast sky holds untold promise!\p"
"Nothing can compare to the sheer\n"
"exhilaration of flight!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2834
msgctxt "Route119_Text_HughDefeat"
msgid "Down and out!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2837
msgctxt "Route119_Text_HughPostBattle"
msgid ""
"My BIRD POKéMON made my dreams of\n"
"flying come true!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2841
msgctxt "Route119_Text_PhilIntro"
msgid ""
"I'll show you the true potential of me\n"
"and my BIRD POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2845
msgctxt "Route119_Text_PhilDefeat"
msgid "We lacked potential…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2848
msgctxt "Route119_Text_PhilPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Ever since I was a little kid, I always\n"
"admired BIRD POKéMON…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2852
msgctxt "Route119_Text_YasuIntro"
msgid ""
"To lurk in shadows, and live in\n"
"darkness… That is my destiny.\p"
"I emerge to challenge you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2857
msgctxt "Route119_Text_YasuDefeat"
msgid "I admit defeat!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2860
msgctxt "Route119_Text_YasuPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Those defeated in battle withdraw\n"
"quietly back into the shadows.\l"
"That, too, is destiny…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2865
msgctxt "Route119_Text_TakashiIntro"
msgid ""
"If you're not on your guard,\n"
"you're in for some pain!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2869
msgctxt "Route119_Text_TakashiDefeat"
msgid "You're surprisingly good!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2872
msgctxt "Route119_Text_TakashiPostBattle"
msgid ""
"My surprise attack ended in\n"
"failure…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2876
msgctxt "Route119_Text_HideoIntro"
msgid "To hide a tree, use a forest!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2879
msgctxt "Route119_Text_HideoDefeat"
msgid "I bow to your superiority.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2882
msgctxt "Route119_Text_HideoPostBattle"
msgid ""
"To hide a tree, use a forest!\n"
"To hide a POKéMON, use a POKéMON!\p"
"There is no deep, hidden meaning\n"
"to that.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2888
msgctxt "Route119_Text_ChrisIntro"
msgid ""
"You spoke to me…\n"
"So you want to challenge me!\p"
"Sure! I'll try out the POKéMON I caught\n"
"while SURFING!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2894
msgctxt "Route119_Text_ChrisDefeat"
msgid ""
"I don't have a clue about what it\n"
"takes to win.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2898
msgctxt "Route119_Text_ChrisPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Go for a SURF on my POKéMON…\p"
"Then fish off its back…\p"
"It's an indescribably luxuriant moment!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2903
msgctxt "Route119_Text_FabianIntro"
msgid ""
"Hit me with a power chord!\n"
"Victory is mine!\l"
"It's our time to shine, whoa, yeah!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2908
msgctxt "Route119_Text_FabianDefeat"
msgid ""
"You showed me who's the boss!\n"
"We'll have to take the loss, oh, no!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2912
msgctxt "Route119_Text_FabianPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Hit me with another power chord!\n"
"Leave me alone!\l"
"Your win you have to atone!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2917
msgctxt "Route119_Text_DaytonIntro"
msgid ""
"Hohoho!\n"
"I like kid TRAINERS!\l"
"Let's have a good one!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2922
msgctxt "Route119_Text_DaytonDefeat"
msgid ""
"You're pretty amazing!\n"
"Hohoho!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2926
msgctxt "Route119_Text_DaytonPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Hohoho!\n"
"I'll try emulating the pep of kid\l"
"TRAINERS like you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2931
msgctxt "Route119_Text_RachelIntro"
msgid ""
"Wherever and whenever I may be,\n"
"I always have my parasol in hand.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2935
msgctxt "Route119_Text_RachelDefeat"
msgid ""
"Oh, but…\n"
"That's not fair.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2939
msgctxt "Route119_Text_RachelPostBattle"
msgid ""
"You're asking if my parasol is heavy?\n"
"Your BAG is filled with more junk than\l"
"I ever carry around.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2944
msgctxt "Route120_Text_ColinIntro"
msgid ""
"Do you have any moves that can strike\n"
"a flying POKéMON?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2948
msgctxt "Route120_Text_ColinDefeat"
msgid "You soared above me!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2951
msgctxt "Route120_Text_ColinPostBattle"
msgid ""
"The move FLY is convenient,\n"
"don't you think?\p"
"While the POKéMON is flying,\n"
"almost no moves can strike it.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2957
msgctxt "Route120_Text_RobertIntro"
msgid ""
"My POKéMON is strong!\n"
"How about yours?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2961
msgctxt "Route120_Text_RobertDefeat"
msgid "Your POKéMON were stronger…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2964
msgctxt "Route120_Text_RobertPostBattle"
msgid ""
"A POKéMON that grows steadily is one\n"
"you can count on.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2968
msgctxt "Route120_Text_RobertRegister"
msgid ""
"You can be counted on to get better.\n"
"I'd like to register you in my POKéNAV!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2972
msgctxt "Route120_Text_RobertRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"A POKéMON that grows steadily is one\n"
"you can count on.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2976
msgctxt "Route120_Text_RobertRematchDefeat"
msgid "Your POKéMON are seriously strong.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2979
msgctxt "Route120_Text_RobertPostRematch"
msgid ""
"My POKéMON are growing stronger.\n"
"I have to grow stronger, too.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2983
msgctxt "Route120_Text_LorenzoIntro"
msgid ""
"I'll check your POKéMON and see if\n"
"they're fit for the outdoors.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2987
msgctxt "Route120_Text_LorenzoDefeat"
msgid ""
"With POKéMON that strong, you're in\n"
"no danger of needing rescue!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2991
msgctxt "Route120_Text_LorenzoPostBattle"
msgid ""
"To travel wherever your heart desires\n"
"with POKéMON…\l"
"That's the joy of being a TRAINER.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:2996
msgctxt "Route120_Text_JennaIntro"
msgid ""
"How's your physical fitness?\n"
"If you're not fit, you could have a\l"
"rough time in critical situations.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3001
msgctxt "Route120_Text_JennaDefeat"
msgid "I'm totally fit, but…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3004
msgctxt "Route120_Text_JennaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Fitness training is in my routine.\n"
"I always run with my POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3008
msgctxt "Route120_Text_JeffreyIntro"
msgid ""
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … …\l"
"Want to battle?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3013
msgctxt "Route120_Text_JeffreyDefeat"
msgid "Lost it…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3016
msgctxt "Route120_Text_JeffreyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … …\l"
"I'll try harder…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3021
msgctxt "Route120_Text_JeffreyRegister"
msgid ""
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … …\l"
"Do you have a POKéNAV…?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3026
msgctxt "Route120_Text_JeffreyRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … …\l"
"Want to battle again?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3031
msgctxt "Route120_Text_JeffreyRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"… … … … … …\n"
"I lost again…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3035
msgctxt "Route120_Text_JeffreyPostRematch"
msgid ""
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … …\l"
"I'll try harder…\l"
"For my precious BUG POKéMON…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3041
msgctxt "Route120_Text_JenniferIntro"
msgid ""
"POKéMON have many special abilities.\n"
"If you want to become a first-class\l"
"TRAINER, learn about them.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3046
msgctxt "Route120_Text_JenniferDefeat"
msgid "You're obviously thinking.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3049
msgctxt "Route120_Text_JenniferPostBattle"
msgid ""
"The special abilities of POKéMON\n"
"will make battle styles change.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3053
msgctxt "Route120_Text_ChipIntro"
msgid ""
"Who might you be?\p"
"Are you perhaps searching for ancient\n"
"ruins that are rumored to possibly\l"
"exist according to legend?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3059
msgctxt "Route120_Text_ChipDefeat"
msgid "What a disgraceful setback…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3062
msgctxt "Route120_Text_ChipPostBattle"
msgid ""
"That giant rock… I would like to\n"
"believe it may indeed contain ancient\l"
"ruins. But I see no entrance.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3067
msgctxt "Route120_Text_ClarissaIntro"
msgid ""
"Why am I carrying this parasol?\p"
"I'll tell you if you can win against me.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3071
msgctxt "Route120_Text_ClarissaDefeat"
msgid ""
"A parasol can't ward off POKéMON\n"
"attacks…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3075
msgctxt "Route120_Text_ClarissaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I don't think strong sunlight is good\n"
"for my POKéMON.\l"
"So I shield them with my parasol.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3080
msgctxt "Route120_Text_AngelicaIntro"
msgid ""
"Me, POKéMON, and my parasol…\p"
"If any one of them is missing,\n"
"the picture of beauty will be ruined.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3085
msgctxt "Route120_Text_AngelicaDefeat"
msgid "You've completely ruined my beauty…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3088
msgctxt "Route120_Text_AngelicaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"A parasol wouldn't suit you at all.\p"
"Why, something like this would only\n"
"get in your way.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3093
msgctxt "Route120_Text_KeigoIntro"
msgid ""
"I will adopt the movements of POKéMON\n"
"and create new ninja techniques.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3097
msgctxt "Route120_Text_KeigoDefeat"
msgid ""
"The creation of new ninja techniques\n"
"is but a distant dream…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3101
msgctxt "Route120_Text_KeigoPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Perhaps I ought to apprentice under\n"
"a ninja sensei.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3105
msgctxt "Route120_Text_RileyIntro"
msgid ""
"We ninja conceal ourselves under our\n"
"camouflage cloaks.\l"
"I bet you didn't know where I was!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3110
msgctxt "Route120_Text_RileyDefeat"
msgid ""
"I lost!\n"
"I should camouflage my shame!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3114
msgctxt "Route120_Text_RileyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Our camouflage cloaks are all\n"
"handmade.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3118
msgctxt "Route120_Text_CallieIntro"
msgid ""
"If you don't pay attention,\n"
"you could get hurt!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3122
msgctxt "Route120_Text_CallieDefeat"
msgid ""
"Ouch!\n"
"I was the one to get hurt.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3126
msgctxt "Route120_Text_CalliePostBattle"
msgid ""
"I wonder… Should I evolve my POKéMON?\n"
"They're cute the way they are, though.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3130
msgctxt "Route120_Text_LeonelIntro"
msgid ""
"Your party POKéMON…\n"
"Do you have different types?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3134
msgctxt "Route120_Text_LeonelDefeat"
msgid "I've seen your policy in action!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3137
msgctxt "Route120_Text_LeonelPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I think it's awesome you're so strong\n"
"battling with your favorite POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3141
msgctxt "Route121_Text_VanessaIntro"
msgid ""
"Will you play with my delightfully\n"
"pretty POKéMON?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3145
msgctxt "Route121_Text_VanessaDefeat"
msgid "This isn't what I meant!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3148
msgctxt "Route121_Text_VanessaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I'm going to a CONTEST in LILYCOVE.\p"
"My POKéMON should have no problem\n"
"sweeping the MASTER CLASS.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3153
msgctxt "Route121_Text_WalterIntro"
msgid ""
"With my POKéMON, I have traveled\n"
"to the world's four corners.\p"
"You might say I have some confidence\n"
"in my abilities.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3159
msgctxt "Route121_Text_WalterDefeat"
msgid "Ah, well played.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3162
msgctxt "Route121_Text_WalterPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I would like to circle the globe once\n"
"again with my POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3166
msgctxt "Route121_Text_WalterRegister"
msgid ""
"Your POKéMON prowess is remarkable.\n"
"Allow me to register you as a memento.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3170
msgctxt "Route121_Text_WalterRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"With my POKéMON, I have traveled\n"
"to the world's four corners.\p"
"You might say I have some confidence\n"
"in my abilities.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3176
msgctxt "Route121_Text_WalterRematchDefeat"
msgid "Ah, well played.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3179
msgctxt "Route121_Text_WalterPostRematch"
msgid ""
"Your POKéMON and you…\p"
"Your prowess together will be\n"
"considered strong, even overseas.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3184
msgctxt "Route121_Text_TammyIntro"
msgid ""
"There are powers beyond our\n"
"understanding in the world…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3188
msgctxt "Route121_Text_TammyDefeat"
msgid "I have lost…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3191
msgctxt "Route121_Text_TammyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"MT. PYRE…\n"
"There is a mysterious power\l"
"at work there…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3196
msgctxt "Route121_Text_KateIntro"
msgid ""
"KATE: Together, we're fearless!\n"
"We'll demonstrate how tough we are!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3200
msgctxt "Route121_Text_KateDefeat"
msgid ""
"KATE: I blew it in front of my junior\n"
"student partner…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3204
msgctxt "Route121_Text_KatePostBattle"
msgid ""
"KATE: When someone's relying on me,\n"
"I get this urge to look cool in front\l"
"of them…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3209
msgctxt "Route121_Text_KateNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"KATE: If you've only got one POKéMON,\n"
"we can't battle with you.\p"
"That would be bullying.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3214
msgctxt "Route121_Text_JoyIntro"
msgid ""
"JOY: Together, we're fearless!\n"
"We'll demonstrate how tough we are!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3218
msgctxt "Route121_Text_JoyDefeat"
msgid "JOY: Please forgive me, KATE!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3221
msgctxt "Route121_Text_JoyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"JOY: Ehehe, I'll have to train with KATE,\n"
"my senior student partner, again.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3225
msgctxt "Route121_Text_JoyNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"JOY: You need at least two POKéMON\n"
"if you're going to challenge us!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3229
msgctxt "Route121_Text_JessicaIntro"
msgid ""
"Stop! Have a good look at my precious\n"
"POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3233
msgctxt "Route121_Text_JessicaDefeat"
msgid ""
"Oh, how dare you!\n"
"Don't take it so seriously!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3237
msgctxt "Route121_Text_JessicaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Maybe I'll go catch more POKéMON at\n"
"the SAFARI.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3241
msgctxt "Route121_Text_JessicaRegister"
msgid ""
"I took it easy on you this time!\n"
"It won't be that way the next time!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3245
msgctxt "Route121_Text_JessicaRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"My precious POKéMON grew!\n"
"Have a good look!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3249
msgctxt "Route121_Text_JessicaRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"Oh, how dare you!\n"
"You still won't take it easy!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3253
msgctxt "Route121_Text_JessicaPostRematch"
msgid ""
"Maybe I'll go catch more POKéMON at\n"
"the SAFARI.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3257
msgctxt "Route121_Text_CristinIntro"
msgid ""
"I have this routine.\n"
"Defeat five TRAINERS a day.\l"
"Guess what? You're number five!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3262
msgctxt "Route121_Text_CristinDefeat"
msgid ""
"No!\n"
"You're horrid!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3266
msgctxt "Route121_Text_CristinPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I didn't expect to lose this easily…\n"
"I'll win next time!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3270
msgctxt "Route121_Text_CristinRegister"
msgid ""
"That was total humiliation!\n"
"I won't forget you…\l"
"Hand over your POKéNAV!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3275
msgctxt "Route121_Text_CristinRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"I have this new routine.\n"
"Defeat ten TRAINERS a day.\l"
"Guess what? You're number ten!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3280
msgctxt "Route121_Text_CristinRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"Wait! That's nasty!\n"
"I demand a rematch!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3284
msgctxt "Route121_Text_CristinPostRematch"
msgid ""
"An opponent I just can't beat…\n"
"Snivel…\l"
"I can't believe this is happening…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3289
msgctxt "Route121_Text_CaleIntro"
msgid ""
"Can't you see that I have all this\n"
"stuff with me?\p"
"Despite that, you still insist that\n"
"we battle?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3295
msgctxt "Route121_Text_CaleDefeat"
msgid ""
"Of course I lost!\n"
"I'm holding stuff in both hands!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3299
msgctxt "Route121_Text_CalePostBattle"
msgid ""
"I bought too much stuff at\n"
"the LILYCOVE DEPT. STORE.\p"
"It's up the road from here.\n"
"I wish I had a BAG like yours.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3305
msgctxt "Route121_Text_MylesIntro"
msgid ""
"There's nothing I love more than\n"
"checking out other people's POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3309
msgctxt "Route121_Text_MylesDefeat"
msgid "Super awesome!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3312
msgctxt "Route121_Text_MylesPostBattle"
msgid ""
"They're great, your POKéMON!\n"
"How do you raise them?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3316
msgctxt "Route121_Text_PatIntro"
msgid ""
"I want everybody to see the POKéMON\n"
"I've raised!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3320
msgctxt "Route121_Text_PatDefeat"
msgid ""
"Wow!\n"
"Spectacular!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3324
msgctxt "Route121_Text_PatPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I raise every POKéMON with the same\n"
"love and care--I don't pick favorites.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3328
msgctxt "Route121_Text_MarcelIntro"
msgid ""
"My POKéMON have never tasted defeat!\n"
"On their next win, I'm entering them\l"
"in CONTESTS.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3333
msgctxt "Route121_Text_MarcelDefeat"
msgid "Oh, now what happened here?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3336
msgctxt "Route121_Text_MarcelPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I may have to train my gang some more\n"
"before entering any CONTEST.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3340
msgctxt "Route123_Text_WendyIntro"
msgid ""
"Want to determine how strong you are?\n"
"I'll be the test!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3344
msgctxt "Route123_Text_WendyDefeat"
msgid "You passed with flying colors!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3347
msgctxt "Route123_Text_WendyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"To best even me…\n"
"Your strength is marvelous!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3351
msgctxt "Route123_Text_BraxtonIntro"
msgid ""
"You seem to have a big collection\n"
"of GYM BADGES.\p"
"Let me see if you're actually worthy of\n"
"those BADGES!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3357
msgctxt "Route123_Text_BraxtonDefeat"
msgid "Oh, you're worthy, all right!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3360
msgctxt "Route123_Text_BraxtonPostBattle"
msgid ""
"You did your BADGES proud in that\n"
"match!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3364
msgctxt "Route123_Text_VioletIntro"
msgid ""
"They say that good times are filled\n"
"with good aromas.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3368
msgctxt "Route123_Text_VioletDefeat"
msgid ""
"Oh…\n"
"I smell the bitter scent of misery…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3372
msgctxt "Route123_Text_VioletPostBattle"
msgid ""
"The BERRY MASTER's garden is filled\n"
"with uplifting fragrances.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3376
msgctxt "Route123_Text_CameronIntro"
msgid ""
"Being a psychic is about willpower.\p"
"I've willed myself not to lose to\n"
"anyone. That makes me strong!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3381
msgctxt "Route123_Text_CameronDefeat"
msgid "I feel sad…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3384
msgctxt "Route123_Text_CameronPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Being a psychic is about willpower.\n"
"I thought I wouldn't lose to you…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3388
msgctxt "Route123_Text_CameronRegister"
msgid ""
"I sense it!\n"
"You and I shall battle again!\l"
"I can't tell if I'll win, though…\p"
"Let's see your POKéNAV.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3394
msgctxt "Route123_Text_CameronRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"I've convinced myself that I won't\n"
"lose anymore. That makes me strong!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3398
msgctxt "Route123_Text_CameronRematchDefeat"
msgid "I feel sad…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3401
msgctxt "Route123_Text_CameronPostRematch"
msgid ""
"I should train at MT. PYRE…\n"
"I'll never beat you this way…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3405
msgctxt "Route123_Text_JackiIntro"
msgid ""
"Don't be too happy if your POKéMON\n"
"develop psychic powers.\p"
"You need to refine those powers to\n"
"make them really useful.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3411
msgctxt "Route123_Text_JackiDefeat"
msgid "Overwhelmed!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3414
msgctxt "Route123_Text_JackiPostBattle"
msgid ""
"We all have psychic powers.\n"
"We've just forgotten how to use them.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3418
msgctxt "Route123_Text_JackiRegister"
msgid ""
"I would like to face you again.\n"
"Is that okay with you?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3422
msgctxt "Route123_Text_JackiRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"Have you awoken the psychic powers\n"
"within you?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3426
msgctxt "Route123_Text_JackiRematchDefeat"
msgid "Astounding!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3429
msgctxt "Route123_Text_JackiPostRematch"
msgid ""
"Your power with POKéMON…\n"
"That could be a psychic power, too.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3433
msgctxt "Route123_Text_MiuIntro"
msgid ""
"MIU: Hello, TRAINER. I hope your\n"
"POKéMON won't cry when they lose.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3437
msgctxt "Route123_Text_MiuDefeat"
msgid "MIU: Uh-oh, we lost.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3440
msgctxt "Route123_Text_MiuPostBattle"
msgid ""
"MIU: TRAINER, your POKéMON are\n"
"strong because you are friends.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3444
msgctxt "Route123_Text_MiuNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"MIU: It's no fun to battle if you\n"
"don't have two POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3448
msgctxt "Route123_Text_YukiIntro"
msgid ""
"YUKI: Okay!\n"
"We're beating the TRAINER's POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3452
msgctxt "Route123_Text_YukiDefeat"
msgid "YUKI: Uh-oh, we lost.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3455
msgctxt "Route123_Text_YukiPostBattle"
msgid ""
"YUKI: Why are you so strong?\n"
"We've never lost before.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3459
msgctxt "Route123_Text_YukiNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"YUKI: It's no fun to battle if you\n"
"don't have two POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3463
msgctxt "Route123_Text_KindraIntro"
msgid ""
"MT. PYRE…\n"
"Where the spirits of POKéMON sleep…\l"
"Will your POKéMON sleep?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3468
msgctxt "Route123_Text_KindraDefeat"
msgid "Overflowing with vitality…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3471
msgctxt "Route123_Text_KindraPostBattle"
msgid ""
"MT. PYRE…\n"
"Where the spirits of POKéMON sleep…\p"
"It must overflow with a power that\n"
"soothes spirits…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3477
msgctxt "Route123_Text_FernandoIntro"
msgid ""
"I'll turn your lights out while\n"
"I rip through this tune!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3481
msgctxt "Route123_Text_FernandoDefeat"
msgid ""
"Hey, hold it!\n"
"I was still playing the intro!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3485
msgctxt "Route123_Text_FernandoPostBattle"
msgid ""
"You're rock steady.\n"
"I'd like to write a tune about you.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3489
msgctxt "Route123_Text_FernandoRegister"
msgid ""
"The next time, lend your ears to\n"
"the full tune, will you?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3493
msgctxt "Route123_Text_FernandoRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"Today's the day I'm going to do it!\n"
"I'll turn out your lights before\l"
"I finish singing my song!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3498
msgctxt "Route123_Text_FernandoRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"Hey, hold it!\n"
"I haven't even hit the chorus!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3502
msgctxt "Route123_Text_FernandoPostRematch"
msgid ""
"I thought you'd be so enthralled\n"
"by my tune, you'd lose.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3506
msgctxt "Route123_Text_DavisIntro"
msgid ""
"This is my awesome BUG POKéMON!\n"
"My big brother got it for me.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3510
msgctxt "Route123_Text_DavisDefeat"
msgid ""
"Waaaah!\n"
"You meanie!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3514
msgctxt "Route123_Text_DavisPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Don't tell my brother I lost.\n"
"You have to keep it a secret!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3518
msgctxt "Route123_Text_JazmynIntro"
msgid ""
"My confidence will get a boost by\n"
"beating someone obviously strong!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3522
msgctxt "Route123_Text_JazmynDefeat"
msgid "There goes my confidence…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3525
msgctxt "Route123_Text_JazmynPostBattle"
msgid ""
"They say that you can't judge a person\n"
"by their appearance.\p"
"But often, their looks don't lie…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3530
msgctxt "Route123_Text_FrederickIntro"
msgid ""
"Hello, child!\n"
"Can you spare some time?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3534
msgctxt "Route123_Text_FrederickDefeat"
msgid ""
"Ah, a mighty capable child!\n"
"Let me contribute to your allowance.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3538
msgctxt "Route123_Text_FrederickPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Contribute to your allowance?\n"
"Wasn't the prize money enough?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3542
msgctxt "Route123_Text_AlbertoIntro"
msgid ""
"I have to tell you, BIRD POKéMON\n"
"are my obsession!\p"
"Birds are cool!\n"
"They're the best!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3548
msgctxt "Route123_Text_AlbertoDefeat"
msgid "Even in defeat, BIRD POKéMON are cool!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3551
msgctxt "Route123_Text_AlbertoPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I gather BIRD POKéMON feathers that\n"
"scatter during battles.\p"
"I'm going to make a hat with\n"
"BIRD POKéMON feathers.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3557
msgctxt "Route123_Text_EdIntro"
msgid ""
"When there are no TRAINERS around,\n"
"I let my POKéMON battle each other.\l"
"I watch them.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3562
msgctxt "Route123_Text_EdDefeat"
msgid "I kind of like your POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3565
msgctxt "Route123_Text_EdPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Hehe, I'm swiping your battling ideas!\n"
"I think they'll make me better.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3569
msgctxt "Route123_Text_JonasIntro"
msgid ""
"I lay in ambush, and a TRAINER has\n"
"landed in my trap!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3573
msgctxt "Route123_Text_JonasDefeat"
msgid ""
"If you don't lose, how am I supposed\n"
"to have fun playing ninja?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3577
msgctxt "Route123_Text_JonasPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I'm going to ambush a weaker-looking\n"
"TRAINER next time.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3581
msgctxt "Route123_Text_KayleyIntro"
msgid ""
"I just bought this parasol.\n"
"My cuteness should be up by a third!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3585
msgctxt "Route123_Text_KayleyDefeat"
msgid ""
"You're better than me by about\n"
"five times!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3589
msgctxt "Route123_Text_KayleyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Using accessories effectively is\n"
"the secret behind fashion appeal.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3593
msgctxt "Route124_Text_SpencerIntro"
msgid ""
"Hey, are you lost at sea?\p"
"If you can beat my POKéMON,\n"
"I can serve as your pilot.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3598
msgctxt "Route124_Text_SpencerDefeat"
msgid "I lost my bearings in battle!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3601
msgctxt "Route124_Text_SpencerPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Many people lose their bearings at sea.\p"
"If you're that sort, you should refer\n"
"to the POKéNAV's MAP.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3606
msgctxt "Route124_Text_RolandIntro"
msgid ""
"Hm! You're riding a POKéMON instead\n"
"of swimming yourself…\p"
"I am envious!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3611
msgctxt "Route124_Text_RolandDefeat"
msgid ""
"Oh!\n"
"I can't…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3615
msgctxt "Route124_Text_RolandPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I'm getting chilled…\n"
"I've been in the water too long…\p"
"I wish I could ride a POKéMON like you…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3620
msgctxt "Route124_Text_JennyIntro"
msgid ""
"If you just float in the sea like\n"
"this, POKéMON come around to play.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3624
msgctxt "Route124_Text_JennyDefeat"
msgid ""
"Oh, darn.\n"
"I've gone and lost.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3628
msgctxt "Route124_Text_JennyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"While swimming, I noticed that some\n"
"POKéMON attack, and some just watch.\p"
"I guess POKéMON have personalities\n"
"of their own.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3634
msgctxt "Route124_Text_JennyRegister"
msgid ""
"It's only on a whim, but maybe I'll get\n"
"you to register me in your POKéNAV.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3638
msgctxt "Route124_Text_JennyRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"If you just float in the sea like this,\n"
"TRAINERS challenge you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3642
msgctxt "Route124_Text_JennyRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"That's strange…\n"
"I lost again…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3646
msgctxt "Route124_Text_JennyPostRematch"
msgid ""
"This has nothing to do with anything,\n"
"but maybe I'll visit the TRICK HOUSE.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3650
msgctxt "Route124_Text_GraceIntro"
msgid ""
"I'm growing bored of swimming…\n"
"How about a battle?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3654
msgctxt "Route124_Text_GraceDefeat"
msgid ""
"I had no idea that you were\n"
"this strong!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3658
msgctxt "Route124_Text_GracePostBattle"
msgid ""
"All the effort you put in must have\n"
"made you this strong.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3662
msgctxt "Route124_Text_ChadIntro"
msgid ""
"Fufufufu… I dive deep underwater\n"
"to go deep under cover.\l"
"Plumbing the depths is where I excel!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3667
msgctxt "Route124_Text_ChadDefeat"
msgid ""
"Glub, glub, glub…\n"
"I'm sinking…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3671
msgctxt "Route124_Text_ChadPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I have it on good authority that\n"
"there's a DIVE spot around here.\p"
"It gives me the urge to go deep\n"
"again…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3677
msgctxt "Route124_Text_LilaIntro"
msgid ""
"LILA: Sigh…\p"
"Here I am in the sea, but who's with me?\n"
"My little brother!\p"
"Let's battle so I won't have to dwell\n"
"on that!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3684
msgctxt "Route124_Text_LilaDefeat"
msgid ""
"LILA: ROY! It's your fault we lost!\n"
"You're in for it later!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3688
msgctxt "Route124_Text_LilaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"LILA: Sigh…\p"
"If only it wasn't my little brother\n"
"next to me, but a nice boyfriend…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3693
msgctxt "Route124_Text_LilaNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"LILA: You're planning to battle us?\n"
"Not unless you have two POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3697
msgctxt "Route124_Text_RoyIntro"
msgid ""
"ROY: My big sister is tough at POKéMON!\p"
"Don't cry when you lose!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3701
msgctxt "Route124_Text_RoyDefeat"
msgid ""
"ROY: Uh-oh…\n"
"My big sister will chew me out…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3705
msgctxt "Route124_Text_RoyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"ROY: My big sister is really scary\n"
"when she gets angry.\p"
"That's why she doesn't have a\n"
"boyfriend.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3711
msgctxt "Route124_Text_LilaRoyRegister"
msgid ""
"ROY: Will you battle with us again?\n"
"But take it easy next time, okay?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3715
msgctxt "Route124_Text_RoyNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"ROY: Did you want to battle us?\n"
"Bring two POKéMON, then.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3719
msgctxt "Route124_Text_LilaRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"LILA: Sigh…\p"
"Here I am in the sea, but who's with me?\n"
"My little brother!\p"
"Oh, hi, it's been a while. Let's battle\n"
"so I won't have to dwell on things!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3726
msgctxt "Route124_Text_LilaRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"LILA: ROY!\n"
"It's your fault we lost again!\p"
"We're having a training session later!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3731
msgctxt "Route124_Text_LilaPostRematch"
msgid ""
"LILA: Sigh…\p"
"If I had a nice boyfriend, we'd beat\n"
"anyone with lovely combinations…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3736
msgctxt "Route124_Text_LilaRematchNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"LILA: You're planning to battle us?\n"
"Not unless you have two POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3740
msgctxt "Route124_Text_RoyRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"ROY: If we lose, I'll catch heck.\n"
"I'm going to go totally all out!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3744
msgctxt "Route124_Text_RoyRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"ROY: Uh-oh…\n"
"My big sister will chew me out again.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3748
msgctxt "Route124_Text_RoyPostRematch"
msgid ""
"ROY: My big sister is really scary\n"
"when she gets angry.\p"
"She's going to make me train really\n"
"hard with POKéMON later…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3754
msgctxt "Route124_Text_RoyRematchNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"ROY: Did you want to battle us?\n"
"Bring two POKéMON, then.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3758
msgctxt "Route124_Text_DeclanIntro"
msgid ""
"Here I am swimming by my lonesome\n"
"on this wide, beautiful sea.\p"
"There's no other word for it.\n"
"This is pathetic!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3764
msgctxt "Route124_Text_DeclanDefeat"
msgid ""
"I'm feeling blue.\n"
"Blue as the sky…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3768
msgctxt "Route124_Text_DeclanPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I should chat up lady SWIMMERS\n"
"and invite them on a long swim.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3772
msgctxt "Route124_Text_IsabellaIntro"
msgid ""
"I'm not going to lose to some\n"
"surfer TRAINER.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3776
msgctxt "Route124_Text_IsabellaDefeat"
msgid ""
"I've only got sweat in my eyes!\n"
"I am not crying!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3780
msgctxt "Route124_Text_IsabellaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"You can find pretty colored shards\n"
"of things around here.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3784
msgctxt "Route125_Text_NolenIntro"
msgid ""
"I heard you approaching, so I hung\n"
"around for you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3788
msgctxt "Route125_Text_NolenDefeat"
msgid "I surrender!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3791
msgctxt "Route125_Text_NolenPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Sound travels faster in water than\n"
"it does through air.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3795
msgctxt "Route125_Text_StanIntro"
msgid ""
"Hey, there!\n"
"Check out my sweet POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3799
msgctxt "Route125_Text_StanDefeat"
msgid "I floundered…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3802
msgctxt "Route125_Text_StanPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I was blown away by HORSEA's charm,\n"
"so I started swimming, too.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3806
msgctxt "Route125_Text_TanyaIntro"
msgid ""
"I'm tired of swimming.\n"
"Are you up for a battle with me?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3810
msgctxt "Route125_Text_TanyaDefeat"
msgid "You're too much!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3813
msgctxt "Route125_Text_TanyaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Whew…\n"
"Which way is it to MOSSDEEP CITY?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3817
msgctxt "Route125_Text_SharonIntro"
msgid ""
"How would you like to take on the\n"
"WATER-type POKéMON I raised?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3821
msgctxt "Route125_Text_SharonDefeat"
msgid "Lost it…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3824
msgctxt "Route125_Text_SharonPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Your power… You're the real deal.\n"
"I'm amazed!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3828
msgctxt "Route125_Text_ErnestIntro"
msgid ""
"Ahoy! I'm a buff, tough SAILOR!\n"
"I've braved the world's seas!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3832
msgctxt "Route125_Text_ErnestDefeat"
msgid ""
"Gwrroooar!\n"
"I couldn't win!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3836
msgctxt "Route125_Text_ErnestPostBattle"
msgid ""
"The tide ebbs and flows inside the\n"
"SHOAL CAVE.\p"
"By the way, it's about six hours from\n"
"high tide to low tide. Did you know?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3842
msgctxt "Route125_Text_ErnestRegister"
msgid ""
"Register me in your POKéNAV,\n"
"and I'll tell you something good.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3846
msgctxt "Route125_Text_ErnestRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"It's high time I get my payback\n"
"from you! Come on, we're battling!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3850
msgctxt "Route125_Text_ErnestRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"I couldn't win!\n"
"I flat out couldn't win!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3854
msgctxt "Route125_Text_ErnestRematchPostBattle"
msgid ""
"The SHOAL CAVE…\p"
"There are places you can and can't\n"
"get to depending on the rise and fall\l"
"of the tide.\p"
"By the way, it's about six hours from\n"
"high tide to low tide. Don't forget!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3862
msgctxt "Route125_Text_KimIntro"
msgid ""
"KIM: A funny old man lives in the\n"
"SHOAL CAVE. Someone told me.\l"
"Are you going to see him, too?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3867
msgctxt "Route125_Text_KimDefeat"
msgid "KIM: I thought we would win.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3870
msgctxt "Route125_Text_KimPostBattle"
msgid ""
"KIM: A funny old man lives in the\n"
"SHOAL CAVE, doesn't he?\p"
"Let's go see him, IRIS!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3875
msgctxt "Route125_Text_KimNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"KIM: No, no, no! You need two POKéMON,\n"
"or it's just no good!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3879
msgctxt "Route125_Text_IrisIntro"
msgid ""
"IRIS: KIM, can you tell me what we're\n"
"looking for out here?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3883
msgctxt "Route125_Text_IrisDefeat"
msgid "IRIS: Oh, we came sort of close.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3886
msgctxt "Route125_Text_IrisPostBattle"
msgid ""
"IRIS: KIM, are we really going into\n"
"the SHOAL CAVE?\l"
"We'll get all wet.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3891
msgctxt "Route125_Text_IrisNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"IRIS: Oh, we could never, ever do\n"
"anything like a 2-on-1 battle.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3895
msgctxt "Route125_Text_PresleyIntro"
msgid ""
"Why would a BIRDKEEPER like me\n"
"come out to the sea?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3899
msgctxt "Route125_Text_PresleyDefeat"
msgid ""
"Okay.\n"
"I'll tell you why I'm here.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3903
msgctxt "Route125_Text_PresleyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I put a message in a bottle and put\n"
"it out to sea.\p"
"I'm sure that a girl SWIMMER will\n"
"find it!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3909
msgctxt "Route125_Text_AuronIntro"
msgid ""
"Hey! Was it you throwing garbage\n"
"into the sea?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3913
msgctxt "Route125_Text_AuronDefeat"
msgid ""
"Oh, you weren't throwing trash into\n"
"the sea.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3917
msgctxt "Route125_Text_AuronPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I found an unsightly bottle bobbing\n"
"in the waves earlier.\p"
"It angers me that someone would\n"
"pollute the sea!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3923
msgctxt "Route126_Text_BarryIntro"
msgid ""
"Swimming is a full-body workout!\n"
"You will get fit!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3927
msgctxt "Route126_Text_BarryDefeat"
msgid ""
"I admit it!\n"
"You win!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3931
msgctxt "Route126_Text_BarryPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Thanks to my daily swimming routine…\n"
"Look! Feast your eyes on this physique!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3935
msgctxt "Route126_Text_DeanIntro"
msgid ""
"This towering white mountain of rock\n"
"is SOOTOPOLIS CITY.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3939
msgctxt "Route126_Text_DeanDefeat"
msgid "I was done in?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3942
msgctxt "Route126_Text_DeanPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I can't find the entrance to\n"
"SOOTOPOLIS. Where could it be?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3946
msgctxt "Route126_Text_NikkiIntro"
msgid ""
"Ufufufufu!\n"
"I'm a mermaid!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3950
msgctxt "Route126_Text_NikkiDefeat"
msgid ""
"My fantasy burst as if it were a bubble!\n"
"Blub, blub, blub…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3954
msgctxt "Route126_Text_NikkiPostBattle"
msgid ""
"You thrashed me… I want to\n"
"disappear in a wave of despair…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3958
msgctxt "Route126_Text_BrendaIntro"
msgid ""
"Hello, kiddo!\n"
"Want a battle with me?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3962
msgctxt "Route126_Text_BrendaDefeat"
msgid "Oh, noooooh!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3965
msgctxt "Route126_Text_BrendaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I love frolicking with POKéMON in\n"
"the sea like this!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3969
msgctxt "Route126_Text_PabloIntro"
msgid ""
"Check out this sculpted body!\n"
"I'm more cut than a BLACK BELT!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3973
msgctxt "Route126_Text_PabloDefeat"
msgid ""
"Whoops! Too strong!\n"
"Not bad! Not bad at all!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3977
msgctxt "Route126_Text_PabloPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Losing to you stimulated my senses!\n"
"I'll train myself and POKéMON harder!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3981
msgctxt "Route126_Text_PabloRegister"
msgid ""
"Yep, you're not bad at all!\n"
"I'd like to get to know you more!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3985
msgctxt "Route126_Text_PabloRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"Check out this beautiful body!\n"
"I'm more shapely than a SWIMMER!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3989
msgctxt "Route126_Text_PabloRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"Whoops! Really too strong!\n"
"Not bad! Not bad at all!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3993
msgctxt "Route126_Text_PabloPostRematch"
msgid ""
"I'm going to train even harder!\n"
"You're a great motivator!\l"
"You have to come back again!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:3998
msgctxt "Route126_Text_LeonardoIntro"
msgid ""
"I couldn't even swim last year,\n"
"but now I'm a decent SWIMMER.\p"
"I think I'm capable of anything now.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4003
msgctxt "Route126_Text_LeonardoDefeat"
msgid ""
"Sheesh, getting greedy didn't do\n"
"a thing for me.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4007
msgctxt "Route126_Text_LeonardoPostBattle"
msgid ""
"If you practice at something,\n"
"you will get better at it.\p"
"You're young--don't be afraid to\n"
"try all sorts of things!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4013
msgctxt "Route126_Text_IsobelIntro"
msgid ""
"If seawater gets up your nose,\n"
"doesn't it feel terrible?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4017
msgctxt "Route126_Text_IsobelDefeat"
msgid ""
"Ack! Why, you…\n"
"Glub!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4021
msgctxt "Route126_Text_IsobelPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Ooh, I choked on some water!\n"
"It's bitter! It's salty!!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4025
msgctxt "Route126_Text_SiennaIntro"
msgid ""
"I'm throwing my whole heart\n"
"into this!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4029
msgctxt "Route126_Text_SiennaDefeat"
msgid "You had more heart!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4032
msgctxt "Route126_Text_SiennaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I need to cool down now…\n"
"I think I'll go for a dive.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4036
msgctxt "Route127_Text_CamdenIntro"
msgid ""
"I can see it in your face.\n"
"You want to challenge me.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4040
msgctxt "Route127_Text_CamdenDefeat"
msgid "Awawawawawa…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4043
msgctxt "Route127_Text_CamdenPostBattle"
msgid ""
"A well-played match leaves me feeling\n"
"refreshed and serene.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4047
msgctxt "Route127_Text_DonnyIntro"
msgid ""
"Do you have a rival whom you just\n"
"hate to lose against?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4051
msgctxt "Route127_Text_DonnyDefeat"
msgid ""
"Arrrgh!\n"
"I hate losing!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4055
msgctxt "Route127_Text_DonnyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"If you have a rival, don't you get the\n"
"feeling that you have to keep getting\l"
"better?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4060
msgctxt "Route127_Text_JonahIntro"
msgid ""
"Through fishing, I have attained a\n"
"state of becalmed serenity…\p"
"Please, allow me to demonstrate…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4065
msgctxt "Route127_Text_JonahDefeat"
msgid ""
"Though I have lost, my heart remains\n"
"calm…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4069
msgctxt "Route127_Text_JonahPostBattle"
msgid ""
"It matters not that I catch nothing.\n"
"The line remains in the water…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4073
msgctxt "Route127_Text_HenryIntro"
msgid ""
"Whoops! Don't tell me I snagged\n"
"a SURFING POKéMON?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4077
msgctxt "Route127_Text_HenryDefeat"
msgid "I can't keep up!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4080
msgctxt "Route127_Text_HenryPostBattle"
msgid ""
"It'd be a handful if I hooked\n"
"your tough POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4084
msgctxt "Route127_Text_RogerIntro"
msgid ""
"Well, hey! This is a match between\n"
"a POKéMON fan and a fishing buff!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4088
msgctxt "Route127_Text_RogerDefeat"
msgid ""
"No! My line's all tangled!\n"
"The party's over!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4092
msgctxt "Route127_Text_RogerPostBattle"
msgid ""
"My fishing line's doing a dance!\n"
"The tangle tango! Hahaha, snarl!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4096
msgctxt "Route127_Text_AidanIntro"
msgid ""
"BIRD POKéMON have excellent vision.\n"
"They spot prey from great heights.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4100
msgctxt "Route127_Text_AidanDefeat"
msgid "Whew… I give up.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4103
msgctxt "Route127_Text_AidanPostBattle"
msgid ""
"There're lots of diving spots in\n"
"the sea around here.\p"
"You can spot them easily from the sky\n"
"because of their darker color.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4109
msgctxt "Route127_Text_KojiIntro"
msgid ""
"Run in your bare feet.\n"
"That will toughen up your soles!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4113
msgctxt "Route127_Text_KojiDefeat"
msgid ""
"Yowch!\n"
"I got a pebble under a toenail!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4117
msgctxt "Route127_Text_KojiPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Going barefoot feels great.\n"
"But your RUNNING SHOES are cool, too.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4121
msgctxt "Route127_Text_KojiRegister"
msgid ""
"This is what I do to people who beat me!\n"
"I hope we can do this again.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4125
msgctxt "Route127_Text_KojiRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"I still run in my bare feet daily.\n"
"My soles are tough!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4129
msgctxt "Route127_Text_KojiRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"Yowch!\n"
"Pebbles dug into my arches!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4133
msgctxt "Route127_Text_KojiPostRematch"
msgid ""
"Want to go barefoot for a while?\n"
"So I can try your RUNNING SHOES?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4137
msgctxt "Route127_Text_AthenaIntro"
msgid ""
"We should have a slow and methodical\n"
"match.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4141
msgctxt "Route127_Text_AthenaDefeat"
msgid ""
"You didn't give me the chance to\n"
"do any strategizing.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4145
msgctxt "Route127_Text_AthenaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"When I'm surrounded by the blue sea\n"
"and sky, it feels as if time slows down.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4149
msgctxt "Route128_Text_IsaiahIntro"
msgid ""
"EVER GRANDE CITY is still a long ways\n"
"away…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4153
msgctxt "Route128_Text_IsaiahDefeat"
msgid ""
"My first victory seems to be far\n"
"away, too…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4157
msgctxt "Route128_Text_IsaiahPostBattle"
msgid ""
"My whole life has been about losing,\n"
"but I will never give up!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4161
msgctxt "Route128_Text_IsaiahRegister"
msgid ""
"I know I'm not good now, but I think\n"
"I can win eventually.\p"
"Please register me in your POKéNAV.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4166
msgctxt "Route128_Text_IsaiahRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"I'm still feeling good. I'll keep on\n"
"swimming to EVER GRANDE CITY.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4170
msgctxt "Route128_Text_IsaiahRematchDefeat"
msgid "I've yet to taste my first victory…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4173
msgctxt "Route128_Text_IsaiahPostRematch"
msgid ""
"I'll eventually reach EVER GRANDE CITY\n"
"where I can eventually win…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4177
msgctxt "Route128_Text_KatelynIntro"
msgid ""
"You have to swim, cycle, and then run\n"
"a marathon in a triathlon.\p"
"It's a grueling race that consists\n"
"of three events.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4183
msgctxt "Route128_Text_KatelynDefeat"
msgid "A POKéMON battle is grueling, too…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4186
msgctxt "Route128_Text_KatelynPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I have to ride a BIKE next, but…\n"
"I'm about to throw in the towel…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4190
msgctxt "Route128_Text_KatelynRegister"
msgid ""
"Well, I may as well make the best\n"
"of this. I'd like a rematch sometime.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4194
msgctxt "Route128_Text_KatelynRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"A triathlon is long. But I guess the\n"
"road to become the POKéMON CHAMPION\l"
"is also a long and grueling one.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4199
msgctxt "Route128_Text_KatelynRematchDefeat"
msgid ""
"A POKéMON battle really is harsh\n"
"and unforgiving…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4203
msgctxt "Route128_Text_KatelynPostRematch"
msgid ""
"You should give serious thought to\n"
"challenges on VICTORY ROAD.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4207
msgctxt "Route128_Text_AlexaIntro"
msgid ""
"We've been working so hard to mount\n"
"a POKéMON LEAGUE challenge…\p"
"We can't afford to lose now!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4212
msgctxt "Route128_Text_AlexaDefeat"
msgid ""
"Oh!\n"
"How could this happen?!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4216
msgctxt "Route128_Text_AlexaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"After all I've done to get here,\n"
"I won't give up after one setback.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4220
msgctxt "Route128_Text_RubenIntro"
msgid "There is no stronger TRAINER than I!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4223
msgctxt "Route128_Text_RubenDefeat"
msgid "This can't be!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4226
msgctxt "Route128_Text_RubenPostBattle"
msgid ""
"There probably is no stronger TRAINER\n"
"than you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4230
msgctxt "Route128_Text_WayneIntro"
msgid ""
"I want to visit EVER GRANDE, so I\n"
"caught myself a POKéMON that knows\l"
"the move WATERFALL to crest the falls.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4235
msgctxt "Route128_Text_WayneDefeat"
msgid "I'm crestfallen!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4238
msgctxt "Route128_Text_WaynePostBattle"
msgid ""
"Awww, phooey!\p"
"My POKéMON knows WATERFALL, but\n"
"I don't have the SOOTOPOLIS GYM BADGE!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4243
msgctxt "Route128_Text_HarrisonIntro"
msgid ""
"You're looking awfully tough.\n"
"I wonder if I can win?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4247
msgctxt "Route128_Text_HarrisonDefeat"
msgid ""
"Ouch!\n"
"I guess it was impossible to win.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4251
msgctxt "Route128_Text_HarrisonPostBattle"
msgid ""
"There are tough TRAINERS galore\n"
"around EVER GRANDE.\p"
"Do you think I may be out\n"
"of my league?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4257
msgctxt "Route128_Text_CarleeIntro"
msgid ""
"The sunlight seems to be more harsh\n"
"in this area.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4261
msgctxt "Route128_Text_CarleeDefeat"
msgid ""
"I couldn't see very well because of\n"
"the sun's glare.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4265
msgctxt "Route128_Text_CarleePostBattle"
msgid ""
"I should go back soon.\n"
"I need to reapply my sunscreen.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4269
msgctxt "Route129_Text_ChaseIntro"
msgid ""
"This is my first triathlon.\n"
"I'm all tense and nervous!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4273
msgctxt "Route129_Text_ChaseDefeat"
msgid ""
"Wroooaaar!\n"
"I failed to win!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4277
msgctxt "Route129_Text_ChasePostBattle"
msgid ""
"If I'm all tensed up, I won't be able to\n"
"give it my all.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4281
msgctxt "Route129_Text_AllisonIntro"
msgid ""
"I'm in the middle of a triathlon,\n"
"but, sure, why don't we battle?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4285
msgctxt "Route129_Text_AllisonDefeat"
msgid "I was sure I'd win!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4288
msgctxt "Route129_Text_AllisonPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Do you know what's the greatest thing\n"
"about triathlons?\p"
"Testing the limits of your own\n"
"strength and endurance against\l"
"Mother Nature!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4295
msgctxt "Route129_Text_ReedIntro"
msgid ""
"Say hey, hey!\n"
"Let's get on with it!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4299
msgctxt "Route129_Text_ReedDefeat"
msgid ""
"Beat, I'm beaten.\n"
"That's it, done!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4303
msgctxt "Route129_Text_ReedPostBattle"
msgid ""
"There's nothing for a loser.\n"
"Time for me to beat it home.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4307
msgctxt "Route129_Text_TishaIntro"
msgid ""
"What's the hurry?\n"
"Let's take it slow and easy.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4311
msgctxt "Route129_Text_TishaDefeat"
msgid ""
"Oh, my.\n"
"I wanted to relax a little more…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4315
msgctxt "Route129_Text_TishaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Don't you hate making mistakes when\n"
"you're in a rush?\p"
"That's why I try to take things\n"
"slowly.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4321
msgctxt "Route129_Text_ClarenceIntro"
msgid ""
"Surfing isn't as easy as it seems,\n"
"isn't that right?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4325
msgctxt "Route129_Text_ClarenceDefeat"
msgid "Winning sure isn't easy.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4328
msgctxt "Route129_Text_ClarencePostBattle"
msgid ""
"You have your sights on the POKéMON\n"
"LEAGUE? Keep at it!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4332
msgctxt "Route130_Text_RodneyIntro"
msgid ""
"What a surprise! I didn't expect to\n"
"see a TRAINER out in the sea.\p"
"I think we should battle!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4337
msgctxt "Route130_Text_RodneyDefeat"
msgid "This kid's awfully tough…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4340
msgctxt "Route130_Text_RodneyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Your eyes have that look of someone\n"
"who's experienced harsh challenges\l"
"and won. It suits you well!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4345
msgctxt "Route130_Text_KatieIntro"
msgid ""
"In the deep blue sea,\n"
"my shattered blue heart finds\l"
"comfort among waves.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4350
msgctxt "Route130_Text_KatieDefeat"
msgid ""
"Like the vast blue sea,\n"
"the world of POKéMON spans\l"
"depths beyond belief.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4355
msgctxt "Route130_Text_KatiePostBattle"
msgid ""
"The world's children dream\n"
"of one day becoming\l"
"the POKéMON CHAMPION.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4360
msgctxt "Route130_Text_SantiagoIntro"
msgid ""
"Floating on the open sea like this…\n"
"It's peaceful.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4364
msgctxt "Route130_Text_SantiagoDefeat"
msgid "I needed to be a little less peaceful!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4367
msgctxt "Route130_Text_SantiagoPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Swimming and battling like this…\n"
"I'm one happy guy…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4371
msgctxt "Route131_Text_RichardIntro"
msgid ""
"The sea is teeming with POKéMON.\n"
"It's not easy swimming, I tell you.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4375
msgctxt "Route131_Text_RichardDefeat"
msgid ""
"POKéMON raised by TRAINERS are\n"
"seriously tough…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4379
msgctxt "Route131_Text_RichardPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Gasp… Gasp…\n"
"I'm wiped out…\p"
"The going's easy. It's the leaving\n"
"that's the hard part.\p"
"Will I have any energy left to make\n"
"the return trip?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4387
msgctxt "Route131_Text_HermanIntro"
msgid ""
"The sea… The sea… The sea…\n"
"The sea as far as these eyes can see!\l"
"I'm sick and tired of the sea!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4392
msgctxt "Route131_Text_HermanDefeat"
msgid "Bleah!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4395
msgctxt "Route131_Text_HermanPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Bored I am by the sea, but swim I must.\p"
"I'm a born swimmer!\n"
"That's what I am.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4400
msgctxt "Route131_Text_SusieIntro"
msgid ""
"Hi, sweetie, wait!\n"
"We should battle, you and I!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4404
msgctxt "Route131_Text_SusieDefeat"
msgid ""
"You're tough in spite of the way\n"
"you look!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4408
msgctxt "Route131_Text_SusiePostBattle"
msgid ""
"Did you see a guy over there who whines\n"
"that he's bored of the sea?\p"
"That's all talk.\n"
"He's hopelessly in love with the sea!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4414
msgctxt "Route131_Text_KaraIntro"
msgid ""
"Why do men love bathing suits so much?\p"
"They all ogle me!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4418
msgctxt "Route131_Text_KaraDefeat"
msgid "I'm out of my depth!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4421
msgctxt "Route131_Text_KaraPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Maybe it's not my bathing suit that\n"
"makes men look. It must be my beauty!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4425
msgctxt "Route131_Text_ReliIntro"
msgid ""
"RELI: We'll work together as siblings\n"
"to take you on!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4429
msgctxt "Route131_Text_ReliDefeat"
msgid ""
"RELI: We couldn't win even though we\n"
"worked together…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4433
msgctxt "Route131_Text_ReliPostBattle"
msgid ""
"RELI: The people of PACIFIDLOG are\n"
"together with the sea and POKéMON from\l"
"the time they are born.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4438
msgctxt "Route131_Text_ReliNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"RELI: You don't have two POKéMON?\n"
"We can't enjoy a battle, then.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4442
msgctxt "Route131_Text_IanIntro"
msgid ""
"IAN: I'm doing my best together with\n"
"my sis!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4446
msgctxt "Route131_Text_IanDefeat"
msgid ""
"IAN: I did my best with my sis,\n"
"but we still couldn't win…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4450
msgctxt "Route131_Text_IanPostBattle"
msgid ""
"IAN: You know how PACIFIDLOG is\n"
"a floating town?\p"
"So, wherever there is the sea,\n"
"that's a part of PACIFIDLOG!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4456
msgctxt "Route131_Text_IanNotEnoughMons"
msgid ""
"IAN: If you have two POKéMON,\n"
"we'll take you on!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4460
msgctxt "Route131_Text_TaliaIntro"
msgid ""
"If you can beat me, I'll give you some\n"
"great information!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4464
msgctxt "Route131_Text_TaliaDefeat"
msgid ""
"Oh?\n"
"Did I lose?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4468
msgctxt "Route131_Text_TaliaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"There is an odd place nearby.\n"
"There's a huge tower there.\l"
"Why don't you go take a look?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4473
msgctxt "Route131_Text_KevinIntro"
msgid ""
"The people of PACIFIDLOG are\n"
"a peaceful bunch.\p"
"They never get angry.\n"
"That goes for me, too.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4479
msgctxt "Route131_Text_KevinDefeat"
msgid "Oops!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4482
msgctxt "Route131_Text_KevinPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Tch! …Oh, wait.\n"
"I'm not angry. Honestly!\p"
"But, boy, you're strong!\n"
"Hahaha!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4488
msgctxt "Route132_Text_GilbertIntro"
msgid ""
"I used to catch colds all the time as\n"
"a kid, but I became totally fit after\l"
"I started swimming.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4493
msgctxt "Route132_Text_GilbertDefeat"
msgid "I crave more power…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4496
msgctxt "Route132_Text_GilbertPostBattle"
msgid ""
"TRAINERS travel the fields and\n"
"mountains, so they must be fit, too.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4500
msgctxt "Route132_Text_DanaIntro"
msgid ""
"I try not to swim where the currents\n"
"are too strong.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4504
msgctxt "Route132_Text_DanaDefeat"
msgid "Oh, please, no!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4507
msgctxt "Route132_Text_DanaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"If I get swept away, I'll lose all my\n"
"sense of place…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4511
msgctxt "Route132_Text_RonaldIntro"
msgid ""
"Win or lose, you'll never know until\n"
"you try!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4515
msgctxt "Route132_Text_RonaldDefeat"
msgid ""
"Waah!\n"
"I sank in defeat!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4519
msgctxt "Route132_Text_RonaldPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I never battle when I know I'll win.\n"
"I like to battle at the razor's edge of\l"
"victory and defeat!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4524
msgctxt "Route132_Text_KiyoIntro"
msgid ""
"I contemplate POKéMON 24 hours a day.\n"
"How could you possibly beat me?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4528
msgctxt "Route132_Text_KiyoDefeat"
msgid ""
"I lose.\n"
"I will concede defeat.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4532
msgctxt "Route132_Text_KiyoPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Urggh…\n"
"You're a POKéMON fanatic, aren't you?\p"
"You must contemplate POKéMON 24 hours\n"
"a day, don't you?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4538
msgctxt "Route132_Text_MakaylaIntro"
msgid ""
"I'm always with my husband,\n"
"but I can win even without him.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4542
msgctxt "Route132_Text_MakaylaDefeat"
msgid "Oh, I guess I wasn't good enough.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4545
msgctxt "Route132_Text_MakaylaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"That young man over there looks just\n"
"like my husband when he was young.\p"
"He's making me blush!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4550
msgctxt "Route132_Text_JonathanIntro"
msgid ""
"Someone's been watching me intently.\n"
"Was it you?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4554
msgctxt "Route132_Text_JonathanDefeat"
msgid ""
"Wow!\n"
"That's pretty strong, all right!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4558
msgctxt "Route132_Text_JonathanPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I can't shake this feeling that\n"
"someone's watching me.\p"
"I can't concentrate!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4563
msgctxt "Route132_Text_PaxtonIntro"
msgid ""
"Now where could my wife have gone?\n"
"I'm always with her.\l"
"I wonder if I can win on my own.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4568
msgctxt "Route132_Text_PaxtonDefeat"
msgid ""
"Ah, I see that I couldn't manage\n"
"to win on my own after all.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4572
msgctxt "Route132_Text_PaxtonPostBattle"
msgid ""
"My wife must be looking for me.\n"
"I'd best go find her right away.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4576
msgctxt "Route132_Text_DarcyIntro"
msgid ""
"I liked training here by myself.\n"
"It's awful that all these people came!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4580
msgctxt "Route132_Text_DarcyDefeat"
msgid ""
"Okay! I won't complain about other\n"
"people being here.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4584
msgctxt "Route132_Text_DarcyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I suppose I can partner up with that\n"
"old man and challenge that other team.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4588
msgctxt "Route133_Text_FranklinIntro"
msgid ""
"Did the currents carry you here, too?\n"
"This must have been fated.\l"
"Let's battle!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4593
msgctxt "Route133_Text_FranklinDefeat"
msgid ""
"Strong!\n"
"Too much so!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4597
msgctxt "Route133_Text_FranklinPostBattle"
msgid ""
"It's just my luck that a tough TRAINER\n"
"like you would drift here…\l"
"I must be cursed…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4602
msgctxt "Route133_Text_DebraIntro"
msgid ""
"I've led a life of woe and misery…\n"
"I've been cast away, and this is where\l"
"I've drifted…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4607
msgctxt "Route133_Text_DebraDefeat"
msgid "Another loss…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4610
msgctxt "Route133_Text_DebraPostBattle"
msgid ""
"A life adrift…\n"
"I don't want it anymore!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4614
msgctxt "Route133_Text_LindaIntro"
msgid ""
"Welcome!\n"
"I've been expecting you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4618
msgctxt "Route133_Text_LindaDefeat"
msgid "No! Please!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4621
msgctxt "Route133_Text_LindaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"A strong child TRAINER…\n"
"That's so annoying!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4625
msgctxt "Route133_Text_WarrenIntro"
msgid ""
"I want to win like everyone else, but I\n"
"won't raise POKéMON like everyone else.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4629
msgctxt "Route133_Text_WarrenDefeat"
msgid ""
"Darn it!\n"
"My way is still too slack!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4633
msgctxt "Route133_Text_WarrenPostBattle"
msgid ""
"It's way more fun to do things the way\n"
"I want than to be like everybody else.\l"
"I mean, that's obvious!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4638
msgctxt "Route133_Text_BeckIntro"
msgid ""
"I came all the way out here with my\n"
"BIRD POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4642
msgctxt "Route133_Text_BeckDefeat"
msgid ""
"You…\n"
"You're stunningly cool!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4646
msgctxt "Route133_Text_BeckPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I'd like to go back to FORTREE,\n"
"but I've grown to like this place, too.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4650
msgctxt "Route133_Text_MollieIntro"
msgid ""
"I must have battled thousands\n"
"of times. I've lost count.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4654
msgctxt "Route133_Text_MollieDefeat"
msgid ""
"I may have lost thousands of times,\n"
"but a loss still stings.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4658
msgctxt "Route133_Text_MolliePostBattle"
msgid ""
"Keep at this, youngster. So you can\n"
"become like my husband and me.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4662
msgctxt "Route133_Text_ConorIntro"
msgid ""
"Young people are too happy to go with\n"
"the flow. They're without direction.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4666
msgctxt "Route133_Text_ConorDefeat"
msgid "You have a firm sense of purpose.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4669
msgctxt "Route133_Text_ConorPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Don't let others lead you astray.\n"
"Don't lose direction as you grow older.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4673
msgctxt "Route134_Text_JackIntro"
msgid ""
"Even those POKéMON that can swim are\n"
"carried along by the rapid currents.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4677
msgctxt "Route134_Text_JackDefeat"
msgid "Aiyeeeeh!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4680
msgctxt "Route134_Text_JackPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I think POKéMON enjoy the fast-running\n"
"currents around these parts.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4684
msgctxt "Route134_Text_LaurelIntro"
msgid ""
"My LUVDISC are looking for a fun\n"
"match. Will you join us?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4688
msgctxt "Route134_Text_LaurelDefeat"
msgid "Oopsie!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4691
msgctxt "Route134_Text_LaurelPostBattle"
msgid ""
"There's a collector who's after\n"
"the SCALES of LUVDISC.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4695
msgctxt "Route134_Text_AlexIntro"
msgid ""
"Okeydokey! That's enough rest, gang!\n"
"It's time for a match!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4699
msgctxt "Route134_Text_AlexDefeat"
msgid "Tuckered out again…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4702
msgctxt "Route134_Text_AlexPostBattle"
msgid ""
"My BIRD POKéMON get tired quickly after\n"
"a long flight…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4706
msgctxt "Route134_Text_HitoshiIntro"
msgid ""
"You're a POKéMON TRAINER.\n"
"No need for words. We battle now.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4710
msgctxt "Route134_Text_HitoshiDefeat"
msgid ""
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … …$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4714
msgctxt "Route134_Text_HitoshiPostBattle"
msgid ""
"It was I who challenged you, and yet\n"
"I lost. I am deeply shamed…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4718
msgctxt "Route134_Text_AaronIntro"
msgid ""
"The savage tide in this area serves to\n"
"make us stronger than ever.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4722
msgctxt "Route134_Text_AaronDefeat"
msgid "I willingly concede defeat.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4725
msgctxt "Route134_Text_AaronPostBattle"
msgid ""
"We will return for more training at\n"
"METEOR FALLS.\p"
"If you'd like, you should go, too.\n"
"It will definitely toughen you up!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4731
msgctxt "Route134_Text_KelvinIntro"
msgid ""
"O-our boat!\n"
"The tide carried it away!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4735
msgctxt "Route134_Text_KelvinDefeat"
msgid ""
"Awawawawah!\n"
"Please, stop! Please!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4739
msgctxt "Route134_Text_KelvinPostBattle"
msgid ""
"If we can't SURF, how are we supposed\n"
"to get home?\p"
"Actually, I know a fainted POKéMON\n"
"can still SURF, but it feels wrong.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4745
msgctxt "Route134_Text_MarleyIntro"
msgid ""
"Can your POKéMON dodge our\n"
"lightning-quick attacks?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4749
msgctxt "Route134_Text_MarleyDefeat"
msgid ""
"I never knew such a technique existed!\n"
"You've defeated us thoroughly.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4753
msgctxt "Route134_Text_MarleyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I haven't lost my passion for speed.\n"
"I will try harder.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4757
msgctxt "Route134_Text_ReynaIntro"
msgid ""
"My POKéMON can't be taken down\n"
"easily!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4761
msgctxt "Route134_Text_ReynaDefeat"
msgid ""
"You're kidding!\n"
"Explain how I lost!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4765
msgctxt "Route134_Text_ReynaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Haha!\n"
"You won, all right!\p"
"I'll work my way back up by taking on\n"
"TRAINERS I happen to meet!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4771
msgctxt "Route134_Text_HudsonIntro"
msgid ""
"Listen, have you seen another SAILOR\n"
"around here?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4775
msgctxt "Route134_Text_HudsonDefeat"
msgid "Now, that's something!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4778
msgctxt "Route134_Text_HudsonPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Our boat drifted out to sea.\p"
"My buddy's a timid fellow, so I'm\n"
"worried about him.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4783
msgctxt "VSSeeker_Text_BatteryNotChargedNeedXSteps"
msgid ""
"The battery isn't charged enough.\p"
"No. of steps required to fully\n"
"charge the battery: {STR_VAR_1}{PAUSE_UNTIL_PRESS}$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4788
msgctxt "VSSeeker_Text_NoTrainersWithinRange"
msgid ""
"There are no Trainers within range\n"
"who can battle…\p"
"The VS Seeker was turned off.{PAUSE_UNTIL_PRESS}$"
msgstr ""

#: data/text/trainers.inc:4793
msgctxt "VSSeeker_Text_TrainersNotReady"
msgid ""
"The other Trainers don't appear\n"
"to be ready for battle.\p"
"Let's wait till later.{PAUSE_UNTIL_PRESS}$"
msgstr ""
